  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Component Structure**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the core UI components. Specifically, I\'m designing the isolated Canvas controller component and Game Shell UI. I\'m carefully considering how to structure `/src/components/NeonLogo.tsx`, `/src/components/NeonCanvas.tsx`, and `/src/App.tsx`. I have an initial idea: `/src/components/NeonLogo.tsx` should hold a bespoke inline `<svg>` geometric neon wordmark & block emblem for **NEON BLOCK**.\n\n\n**Refining Canvas Control**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the design of `NeonCanvas.tsx`. The component will exclusively manage the `<canvas>` ref and employs a `ResizeObserver` for HiDPI scaling, and `requestAnimationFrame` for the 60fps simulation loop. I\'m prioritizing its complete isolation from React re-renders during gameplay; all gameplay logic is delegated to mutable refs within `NeonCanvas`. I\'m paying extra attention to unified input implementation (touch/mouse drag and drop).\n\n\n**Implementing Input Systems**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the input systems. I\'m focusing on unified input across touch, mouse, and keyboard, including Amazon Fire TV D-pad compatibility. I\'m prioritizing clear touch/mouse drag-and-drop mechanics with a 12px drag threshold for piece placement, considering live previews and invalid placement feedback. I\'m also preparing for keyboard shortcuts, covering arrow keys, enter, space, escape, and other game actions.\n\n\n**Defining Input Logic**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in detailed input logic. I am currently focused on grid cursor navigation and seamless D-pad transitions between the grid and the tray, accommodating both landscape and portrait orientations, I\'m focusing on defining the edge conditions for arrow key navigation, including tray access and returning to the grid, along with enter/space key behavior for slot selection. I am considering `\'h`/`H`/`?`, and other key codes.\n\n\n**Defining Key Interactions**\n\nI\'m now implementing the grid cursor\'s behavior, ensuring it snaps to valid placement spots while keeping the cursor if it\'s already valid. Enter/Space will attempt to place the selected piece at the current grid location. The logic for successful placements, including triggers for actions and auto-selecting the next piece, is in progress. Invalid placements will trigger `playInvalid()`.\n\nI am also defining keyboard shortcuts. Keys 1, 2, and 3 instantly select tray slots. Tab cycles through the tray. Escape, p, MEdiaPlayPause, and GoBack toggle pause. M mutes sound, and R restarts the game when playing or in modals. I\'m also ensuring the held states are cleared on window blur.\n\n\n**Refining Modal Interactions**\n\nI\'m now implementing logic to ensure intuitive navigation using Enter, Space, Escape, and arrow keys across various game states. I\'ve defined behaviors for Title Screen, Game Over, and Pause modals, including D-pad integration for Amazon Fire TV remotes. I\'m focusing on seamless transitions between the grid, HUD controls, and modals. I\'m also ready to implement `/src/components/NeonLogo.tsx` and `/src/components/NeonCanvas.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3936425443248649845"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\n\\ninterface NeonLogoProps {\\n  compact?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const NeonLogo: React.FC<NeonLogoProps> = ({ compact = false }) => {\\n  if (compact) {\\n    return (\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0\\\">\\n        <svg\\n          width=\\\"32\\\"\\n          height=\\\"32\\\"\\n          viewBox=\\\"0 0 36 36\\\"\\n          fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n          className=\\\"shrink-0\\\"\\n        >\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"nb-mini-cyan\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\" y2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#22D3EE\\\" />\\n              <stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#3B82F6\\\" />\\n            </linearGradient>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"nb-mini-purple\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\" y2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#818CF8\\\" />\\n              <stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#A855F7\\\" />\\n            </linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect x=\\\"3\\\" y=\\\"3\\\" width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#082F49\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#nb-mini-cyan)\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\" />\\n          <rect x=\\\"19\\\" y=\\\"3\\\" width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#1E1B4B\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#nb-mini-purple)\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\" />\\n          <rect x=\\\"3\\\" y=\\\"19\\\" width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#1E1B4B\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#nb-mini-purple)\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\" />\\n          <rect x=\\\"19\\\" y=\\\"19\\\" width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#0E7490\\\" stroke=\\\"#67E8F9\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n        <span className=\\\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold tracking-wider text-white whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n          NEON <span className=\\\"text-cyan-400\\\">BLOCK</span>\\n        </span>\\n      </div>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center select-none\\\">\\n      <svg\\n        width=\\\"320\\\"\\n        height=\\\"88\\\"\\n        viewBox=\\\"0 0 320 88\\\"\\n        fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n        role=\\\"img\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"NEON BLOCK\\\"\\n        className=\\\"w-full max-w-[300px] h-auto\\\"\\n      >\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"nb-title-grad\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"320\\\" y2=\\\"0\\\" gradientUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n            <stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#67E8F9\\\" />\\n            <stop offset=\\\"48%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#38BDF8\\\" />\\n            <stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#C084FC\\\" />\\n          </linearGradient>\\n          <filter id=\\\"nb-glow\\\" x=\\\"-15%\\\" y=\\\"-25%\\\" width=\\\"130%\\\" height=\\\"150%\\\">\\n            <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"3.5\\\" result=\\\"blur\\\" />\\n            <feMerge>\\n              <feMergeNode in=\\\"blur\\\" />\\n              <feMergeNode in=\\\"SourceGraphic\\\" />\\n            </feMerge>\\n          </filter>\\n        </defs>\\n\\n        {/* Emblem Cluster */}\\n        <g transform=\\\"translate(14, 16)\\\" filter=\\\"url(#nb-glow)\\\">\\n          <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#083344\\\" stroke=\\\"#22D3EE\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2.2\\\" />\\n          <rect x=\\\"28\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#1E3A8A\\\" stroke=\\\"#60A5FA\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2.2\\\" />\\n          <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"28\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#4C1D95\\\" stroke=\\\"#A78BFA\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2.2\\\" />\\n          <rect x=\\\"28\\\" y=\\\"28\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#0E7490\\\" stroke=\\\"#67E8F9\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2.2\\\" />\\n        </g>\\n\\n        {/* Wordmark */}\\n        <text\\n          x=\\\"82\\\"\\n          y=\\\"42\\\"\\n          fill=\\\"#F8FAFC\\\"\\n          fontSize=\\\"30\\\"\\n          fontWeight=\\\"800\\\"\\n          letterSpacing=\\\"3.5\\\"\\n          fontFamily=\\\"\'Bahnschrift\', \'DIN Alternate\', \'SF Pro Display\', system-ui, sans-serif\\\"\\n          filter=\\\"url(#nb-glow)\\\"\\n        >\\n          NEON\\n        </text>\\n        <text\\n          x=\\\"82\\\"\\n          y=\\\"72\\\"\\n          fill=\\\"url(#nb-title-grad)\\\"\\n          fontSize=\\\"30\\\"\\n          fontWeight=\\\"800\\\"\\n          letterSpacing=\\\"3.5\\\"\\n          fontFamily=\\\"\'Bahnschrift\', \'DIN Alternate\', \'SF Pro Display\', system-ui, sans-serif\\\"\\n          filter=\\\"url(#nb-glow)\\\"\\n        >\\n          BLOCK\\n        </text>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create bespoke inline SVG NEON BLOCK logo and compact header emblem\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/NeonLogo.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating SVG game logo\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create SVG game logo\"}"
