  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Responsive App**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building `/src/App.tsx`, the responsive Game Shell. I\'m prioritizing landscape views for Android tablets with portrait as the fallback. This involves using `flex-col md:flex-row`. Ensuring this implementation aligns with design specifications remains a core goal.\n\n\n**Refining Landscape View**\n\nI\'m now implementing the landscape view, ensuring it handles short landscape heights without clipping. The left sidebar is taking shape with the NeonLogo, score readout using `tabular-nums`, and touch-friendly buttons. I\'ve included the desired keyboard controls for the Fire TV D-pad. The score readouts must be clean and unboxed.\n\n\n**Designing Portrait HUD**\n\nI\'m now focused on the portrait view HUD. It features a compact top strip with score readouts and touch-friendly buttons for essential actions like pausing and restarting. The main stage renders the `<NeonCanvas />` unobstructed, ensuring a smooth transition.\n\n**Overlays and Modals**\n\nI\'m working on overlays and modals now, ensuring they don\'t use `backdrop-filter` over the active WebGL/Canvas viewport, instead using a crisp translucent scrim. The title screen overlay with the neon logo and tagline should now sit cleanly over the neon board. It will have a clear 1-line tagline and 3-short rule.\n\n\n**Defining Game Start UI**\n\nI\'m now implementing the title screen controls. I\'ve designed a clear start button along with a \"How to Play\" option. I\'ve integrated a succinct control hint, and also included a \"Best Score\" readout, if a high score exists.\n\n\n**Implementing Game Over**\n\nI\'m now implementing the game over modal with a clean header indicating the game\'s end and a new best score highlight if applicable. The score summary will use `tabular-nums` for clarity and includes `Score`, `Best Score`, `Max Tile`, `Merges`, and `Lines Cleared`. I\'ve added primary \"Play Again\" and \"Main Menu\" buttons to give players options after a game ends.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1814405260302219228"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useCallback, useEffect, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  HelpCircle,\\n  Pause,\\n  Play,\\n  RotateCcw,\\n  Volume2,\\n  VolumeX,\\n  X,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { NeonCanvas, NeonCanvasHandle } from \'./components/NeonCanvas\';\\nimport { NeonLogo } from \'./components/NeonLogo\';\\nimport { neonAudio } from \'./game/audio\';\\nimport {\\n  loadBestScore,\\n  loadMutedPref,\\n  saveBestScore,\\n  saveMutedPref,\\n} from \'./game/engine\';\\nimport { GameStats, GameStatus } from \'./game/types\';\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const canvasHandleRef = useRef<NeonCanvasHandle>(null);\\n  const hudFirstBtnRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n  const hudButtonRefs = useRef<(HTMLButtonElement | null)[]>([]);\\n  const startBtnRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n  const playAgainBtnRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n  const resumeBtnRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n  const closeHelpBtnRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n\\n  const [status, setStatus] = useState<GameStatus>(\'TITLE_MENU\');\\n  const [showHelp, setShowHelp] = useState(false);\\n  const [muted, setMuted] = useState<boolean>(() => {\\n    const pref = loadMutedPref();\\n    neonAudio.setMuted(pref);\\n    return pref;\\n  });\\n\\n  const [bestScore, setBestScore] = useState<number>(() => loadBestScore());\\n  const [comboLabel, setComboLabel] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n  const comboTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n\\n  const [reducedMotion, setReducedMotion] = useState<boolean>(() => {\\n    if (typeof window === \'undefined\' || !window.matchMedia) return false;\\n    return window.matchMedia(\'(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\').matches;\\n  });\\n\\n  const [stats, setStats] = useState<GameStats>(() => ({\\n    score: 0,\\n    bestScore: loadBestScore(),\\n    maxTile: 0,\\n    mergesCount: 0,\\n    linesCleared: 0,\\n    bestCombo: 0,\\n    turnsPlayed: 0,\\n    isNewBest: false,\\n  }));\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (typeof window === \'undefined\' || !window.matchMedia) return;\\n    const mq = window.matchMedia(\'(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\');\\n    const onChange = () => setReducedMotion(mq.matches);\\n    mq.addEventListener(\'change\', onChange);\\n    return () => mq.removeEventListener(\'change\', onChange);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const handleStatsChange = useCallback((nextStats: GameStats) => {\\n    setStats(nextStats);\\n    if (nextStats.bestScore > bestScore) {\\n      setBestScore(nextStats.bestScore);\\n      saveBestScore(nextStats.bestScore);\\n    }\\n  }, [bestScore]);\\n\\n  const handleComboEvent = useCallback((label: string) => {\\n    if (comboTimerRef.current) {\\n      window.clearTimeout(comboTimerRef.current);\\n    }\\n    setComboLabel(label);\\n    if (label) {\\n      comboTimerRef.current = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n        setComboLabel(\'\');\\n      }, 1500);\\n    }\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const startGame = useCallback(() => {\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setStatus(\'PLAYING\');\\n    canvasHandleRef.current?.startNewGame();\\n    window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n    }, 30);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const toggleMute = useCallback(() => {\\n    setMuted((prev) => {\\n      const next = !prev;\\n      neonAudio.setMuted(next);\\n      saveMutedPref(next);\\n      if (!next) {\\n        neonAudio.unlock();\\n        neonAudio.playSelect();\\n      }\\n      return next;\\n    });\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const pauseGame = useCallback(() => {\\n    if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n      neonAudio.playSelect();\\n      setStatus(\'PAUSED\');\\n    } else if (status === \'PAUSED\') {\\n      neonAudio.playSelect();\\n      setStatus(\'PLAYING\');\\n      window.setTimeout(() => {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }, 30);\\n    }\\n  }, [status]);\\n\\n  const handleGameOver = useCallback((finalStats: GameStats) => {\\n    setStats(finalStats);\\n    if (finalStats.bestScore > bestScore) {\\n      setBestScore(finalStats.bestScore);\\n      saveBestScore(finalStats.bestScore);\\n    }\\n    setStatus(\'GAME_OVER\');\\n  }, [bestScore]);\\n\\n  const returnToTitle = useCallback(() => {\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setStatus(\'TITLE_MENU\');\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Auto-focus primary CTA when modal states transition for seamless D-pad/Keyboard UX\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (showHelp) {\\n      closeHelpBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'TITLE_MENU\') {\\n      startBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'PAUSED\') {\\n      resumeBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'GAME_OVER\') {\\n      playAgainBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    }\\n  }, [status, showHelp]);\\n\\n  // Global keyboard shortcuts for menus & modals\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const onKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      const key = e.key;\\n\\n      if (key === \'m\' || key === \'M\') {\\n        if (status !== \'PLAYING\' || showHelp) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          toggleMute();\\n          return;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      if (showHelp) {\\n        if (key === \'Escape\' || key === \'GoBack\' || key === \'Backspace\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          setShowHelp(false);\\n          if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n            canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n          }\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'TITLE_MENU\') {\\n        if (\\n          (key === \'Enter\' || key === \' \' || key === \'Select\' || key === \'DPadCenter\') &&\\n          document.activeElement?.getAttribute(\'data-action\') !== \'help\'\\n        ) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          startGame();\\n        } else if (key === \'h\' || key === \'H\' || key === \'?\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          setShowHelp(true);\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'PAUSED\') {\\n        if (key === \'Escape\' || key === \'p\' || key === \'P\' || key === \'GoBack\' || key === \'MediaPlayPause\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          pauseGame();\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'GAME_OVER\') {\\n        if (\\n          (key === \'Enter\' || key === \' \' || key === \'Select\' || key === \'DPadCenter\') &&\\n          document.activeElement?.getAttribute(\'data-action\') !== \'menu\'\\n        ) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          startGame();\\n        }\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n  }, [status, showHelp, startGame, pauseGame, toggleMute]);\\n\\n  // Allow D-pad navigation across HUD buttons and back to Canvas\\n  const handleHudButtonKeyDown = (\\n    e: React.KeyboardEvent<HTMLButtonElement>,\\n    idx: number\\n  ) => {\\n    const key = e.key;\\n    if (key === \'ArrowDown\' || key === \'ArrowRight\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      if (idx < hudButtonRefs.current.length - 1) {\\n        hudButtonRefs.current[idx + 1]?.focus();\\n      } else if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }\\n    } else if (key === \'ArrowUp\' || key === \'ArrowLeft\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      if (idx > 0) {\\n        hudButtonRefs.current[idx - 1]?.focus();\\n      } else if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }\\n    } else if (key === \'Escape\' && status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"h-dvh w-screen overflow-hidden bg-[#050711] text-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row\\\">\\n      {/* Portrait / Narrow Top HUD Bar */}\\n      <header className=\\\"md:hidden shrink-0 px-3 py-2 bg-[#070B1A] border-b border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 z-10\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0\\\">\\n          <NeonLogo compact />\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-3 text-xs pl-2 border-l border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-slate-400 mr-1\\\">Score</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono-nums font-bold text-sm text-white\\\">\\n                {stats.score.toLocaleString()}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-slate-400 mr-1\\\">Best</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono-nums font-bold text-sm text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                {bestScore.toLocaleString()}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={pauseGame}\\n            disabled={status === \'TITLE_MENU\' || status === \'GAME_OVER\'}\\n            aria-label={status === \'PAUSED\' ? \'Resume game\' : \'Pause game\'}\\n            className=\\\"neon-focus min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#0D142D] border border-indigo-500/25 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-300 hover:border-cyan-400/50 disabled:opacity-35 transition-colors\\\"\\n          >\\n            {status === \'PAUSED\' ? <Play className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" /> : <Pause className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={startGame}\\n            aria-label=\\\"Restart game\\\"\\n            className=\\\"neon-focus min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#0D142D] border border-indigo-500/25 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-300 hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-colors\\\"\\n          >\\n            <RotateCcw className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={toggleMute}\\n            aria-label={muted ? \'Unmute sound\' : \'Mute sound\'}\\n            className=\\\"neon-focus min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#0D142D] border border-indigo-500/25 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-300 hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-colors\\\"\\n          >\\n            {muted ? <VolumeX className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400\\\" /> : <Volume2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-300\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setShowHelp(true)}\\n            aria-label=\\\"How to play\\\"\\n            className=\\\"neon-focus min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#0D142D] border border-indigo-500/25 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-300 hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-colors\\\"\\n          >\\n            <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </header>\\n\\n      {/* Landscape Tablet & Desktop Left Control Sidebar */}\\n      <aside className=\\\"hidden md:flex md:w-60 lg:w-68 xl:w-72 shrink-0 flex-col justify-between bg-[#070B1A] border-r border-indigo-500/20 p-4 lg:p-5 z-10 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-5\\\">\\n          <NeonLogo compact />\\n\\n          {/* Primary Score Telemetry */}\\n          <div className=\\\"pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 space-y-3\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 tracking-wide\\\">\\n                Score\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\\\">\\n                {stats.score.toLocaleString()}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline justify-between pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/60\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400\\\">Best Score</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-lg font-bold text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                {bestScore.toLocaleString()}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline justify-between\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400\\\">Max Tile</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-base font-semibold text-purple-300\\\">\\n                {stats.maxTile > 0 ? stats.maxTile : \'\342\200\224\'}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline justify-between text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <span>Merges / Lines</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-slate-200\\\">\\n                {stats.mergesCount} / {stats.linesCleared}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Ephemeral Event Callout */}\\n          <div className=\\\"h-6 flex items-center\\\">\\n            {comboLabel && (\\n              <span className=\\\"font-display text-sm font-bold tracking-wider text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                {comboLabel}\\n              </span>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Action Controls (44px+ touch & D-pad targets) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n            <button\\n              ref={(el) => {\\n                hudFirstBtnRef.current = el;\\n                hudButtonRefs.current[0] = el;\\n              }}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={pauseGame}\\n              onKeyDown={(e) => handleHudButtonKeyDown(e, 0)}\\n              disabled={status === \'TITLE_MENU\' || status === \'GAME_OVER\'}\\n              className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/25 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-sm font-medium text-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 disabled:opacity-35 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              {status === \'PAUSED\' ? (\\n                <>\\n                  <Play className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                  <span>Resume</span>\\n                </>\\n              ) : (\\n                <>\\n                  <Pause className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                  <span>Pause</span>\\n                </>\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              ref={(el) => {\\n                hudButtonRefs.current[1] = el;\\n              }}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={startGame}\\n              onKeyDown={(e) => handleHudButtonKeyDown(e, 1)}\\n              className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/25 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-sm font-medium text-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              <RotateCcw className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-purple-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>Restart</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n            <button\\n              ref={(el) => {\\n                hudButtonRefs.current[2] = el;\\n              }}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={toggleMute}\\n              onKeyDown={(e) => handleHudButtonKeyDown(e, 2)}\\n              className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/25 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-sm font-medium text-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              {muted ? (\\n                <>\\n                  <VolumeX className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                  <span>Muted</span>\\n                </>\\n              ) : (\\n                <>\\n                  <Volume2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                  <span>Sound</span>\\n                </>\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              ref={(el) => {\\n                hudButtonRefs.current[3] = el;\\n              }}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setShowHelp(true)}\\n              onKeyDown={(e) => handleHudButtonKeyDown(e, 3)}\\n              className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/25 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-sm font-medium text-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>Rules</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400 pt-1\\\">\\n            Drag or tap to place \302\267 Arrows + Enter/Space (D-Pad) \302\267 Esc Pause\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      {/* Main Playfield Stage */}\\n      <main className=\\\"relative flex-1 min-w-0 min-h-0 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <NeonCanvas\\n          ref={canvasHandleRef}\\n          status={status}\\n          bestScore={bestScore}\\n          reducedMotion={reducedMotion}\\n          onStatsChange={handleStatsChange}\\n          onComboEvent={handleComboEvent}\\n          onGameOver={handleGameOver}\\n          onRequestPause={pauseGame}\\n          onRequestToggleMute={toggleMute}\\n          onRequestHudFocus={() => hudFirstBtnRef.current?.focus()}\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* TITLE SCREEN OVERLAY */}\\n        {status === \'TITLE_MENU\' && !showHelp && (\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-[#050711]/75\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl bg-[#091026]/95 border border-cyan-400/30 shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(34,211,238,0.16)] p-6 sm:p-8 text-center space-y-6\\\">\\n              <NeonLogo />\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                <p>\\n                  Place polyomino blocks onto the 6\303\2276 neon grid.\\n                </p>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  Connect 3 or more matching numbers to merge and upgrade tiles, or fill full rows and columns to clear the board.\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {bestScore > 0 && (\\n                <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  Best Score <span className=\\\"mx-1.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>{\' \'}\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono-nums font-bold text-cyan-300 text-sm\\\">\\n                    {bestScore.toLocaleString()}\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-1\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  ref={startBtnRef}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={startGame}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus w-full sm:w-auto min-w-[168px] min-h-[48px] px-7 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 via-blue-500 to-purple-500 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:via-blue-400 hover:to-purple-400 text-white font-display font-bold text-base tracking-wide shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(56,189,248,0.45)] transition-transform active:scale-[0.98] whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Start Game\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  data-action=\\\"help\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setShowHelp(true)}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus w-full sm:w-auto min-h-[48px] px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0F1838] border border-indigo-400/30 hover:border-cyan-400/60 text-slate-200 font-medium text-sm transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                >\\n                  How to Play\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 pt-1\\\">\\n                Drag or Tap to Place \302\267 Arrows + Enter/Space \302\267 Esc Pause\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* PAUSE MODAL */}\\n        {status === \'PAUSED\' && !showHelp && (\\n          <div\\n            role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n            aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Game Paused\\\"\\n            className=\\\"absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-[#050711]/80\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-sm rounded-2xl bg-[#091026] border border-indigo-400/30 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(99,102,241,0.2)] p-6 space-y-5 text-center\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                <h2 className=\\\"font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-wide text-white\\\">\\n                  Game Paused\\n                </h2>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono-nums\\\">\\n                  Score {stats.score.toLocaleString()} \302\267 Best {bestScore.toLocaleString()}\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  ref={resumeBtnRef}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={pauseGame}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[46px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Resume Game\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={startGame}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F1838] border border-indigo-400/30 hover:border-cyan-400/60 text-slate-100 font-medium text-sm transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Restart\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={toggleMute}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F1838] border border-indigo-400/30 hover:border-cyan-400/60 text-slate-100 font-medium text-sm transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  {muted ? \'Sound: Off\' : \'Sound: On\'}\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setShowHelp(true)}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F1838] border border-indigo-400/30 hover:border-cyan-400/60 text-slate-100 font-medium text-sm transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  How to Play\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={returnToTitle}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent border border-slate-700/80 hover:border-slate-500 text-slate-300 font-medium text-sm transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Main Menu\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* GAME OVER MODAL */}\\n        {status === \'GAME_OVER\' && !showHelp && (\\n          <div\\n            role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n            aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Game Over\\\"\\n            className=\\\"absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-[#050711]/82\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl bg-[#091026] border border-purple-400/35 shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(168,85,247,0.22)] p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-5 text-center\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                <h2 className=\\\"font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-wide text-white\\\">\\n                  Game Over\\n                </h2>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-sm text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  No valid moves remaining\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {stats.isNewBest && (\\n                <div className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                  New Best Score Achieved\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 py-3 border-y border-slate-800/80 text-left\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"px-2\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Final Score</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-2xl font-bold text-white\\\">\\n                    {stats.score.toLocaleString()}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"px-2\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Best Score</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                    {bestScore.toLocaleString()}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"px-2\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Max Tile</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-lg font-semibold text-purple-300\\\">\\n                    {stats.maxTile > 0 ? stats.maxTile : \'\342\200\224\'}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"px-2\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Merges / Lines</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-lg font-semibold text-blue-300\\\">\\n                    {stats.mergesCount} / {stats.linesCleared}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-1\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  ref={playAgainBtnRef}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={startGame}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus flex-1 min-h-[48px] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 via-blue-500 to-purple-500 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:via-blue-400 hover:to-purple-400 text-white font-display font-bold text-base tracking-wide shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(56,189,248,0.4)] transition-transform active:scale-[0.98] whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Play Again\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  data-action=\\\"menu\\\"\\n                  onClick={returnToTitle}\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[48px] px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0F1838] border border-indigo-400/30 hover:border-cyan-400/60 text-slate-200 font-medium text-sm transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Main Menu\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* HOW TO PLAY MODAL */}\\n        {showHelp && (\\n          <div\\n            role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n            aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"How to Play\\\"\\n            className=\\\"absolute inset-0 z-30 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-[#050711]/86\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-lg max-h-[90dvh] overflow-y-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#091026] border border-cyan-400/30 shadow-[0_0_45px_rgba(34,211,238,0.18)] p-6 space-y-5\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <h2 className=\\\"font-display text-xl font-extrabold tracking-wide text-white\\\">\\n                  How to Play NEON BLOCK\\n                </h2>\\n                <button\\n                  ref={closeHelpBtnRef}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    setShowHelp(false);\\n                    if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n                      canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n                    }\\n                  }}\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Close instructions\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"neon-focus min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#0F1838] border border-indigo-400/25 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-300\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"font-semibold text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                    1. Place Polyomino Blocks\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    Drag any of the 3 blocks from the tray onto empty spaces on the 6\303\2276 grid, or tap a block then tap the grid. Placing all 3 blocks deals a fresh tray.\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"font-semibold text-blue-300\\\">\\n                    2. Connect 3+ Tiles to Merge\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    When 3 or more orthogonally connected tiles share the same number, they fuse into one doubled tile (<span className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-slate-200\\\">2 \342\206\222 4 \342\206\222 8 \342\206\222 16 \342\206\222 32...</span>). Cascading chain merges multiply your score!\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"font-semibold text-purple-300\\\">\\n                    3. Fill Rows or Columns to Clear\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    Complete any full 6-tile row or column to trigger a plasma beam clear, awarding bonus points and freeing space on the board.\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"pt-3 border-t border-slate-800 space-y-1.5\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-200\\\">\\n                    Keyboard & Fire TV D-Pad Controls\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <ul className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    <li>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-slate-200 font-medium\\\">Arrow Keys / D-Pad:</span> Move cursor across the grid. Move past the board edge into the tray to pick another block.\\n                    </li>\\n                    <li>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-slate-200 font-medium\\\">Enter / Space / Select:</span> Place active block or select focused tray piece.\\n                    </li>\\n                    <li>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-slate-200 font-medium\\\">1\342\200\2233 / Tab:</span> Quickly switch active tray piece.\\n                    </li>\\n                    <li>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-slate-200 font-medium\\\">Esc / P / M:</span> Pause game or toggle sound.\\n                    </li>\\n                  </ul>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"pt-2 flex justif