  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Upgrading NeonCanvas**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `NeonCanvas.tsx` component. The immediate goal is to ensure it seamlessly supports a `startNewGame` function with optional `dailyChallenge` configuration. The intended flow will allow deterministic starter grids using `createDailyStarterGrid` based on the configuration if the daily challenge is passed.\n\n\n**Optimizing Visuals & Performance**\n\nI\'ve been working on fine-tuning the visual effects and performance. The `triggerFireworks` function now launches vibrant, multi-hued rockets with audio and a subtle screen shake. It automatically triggers on high scores and Daily Challenge completions. Furthermore, I\'ve integrated `particleIntensity` to adjust visual density for performance optimization, enforcing a particle cap to ensure mobile compatibility.\n\n\n"
