    thinking: "**Planning System Architecture**\n\nI\'m now carefully architecting all five requested systems, aiming for clean modularity and zero impact on existing gameplay, controls, scoring, Daily Challenge, or saved data. I\'m focusing on the exact architecture, starting with the first request regarding visual themes and particles.\n\n\n**Defining Theme Structure**\n\nI\'ve established the foundation for unlockable visual themes and particle effects, ensuring they dynamically alter the game\'s canvas elements. Five distinct visual themes are planned, with unlock conditions tied to Daily Milestones and Player Levels. I\'ve also begun sketching out the structure for particle effect styles, starting with a classic neon style.\n\n\n**Implementing Visual Themes**\n\nI\'m expanding the theme system, including \"Prism Shards\" at Daily Milestone Day 7, and \"Supernova Rings\" at Day 30. Backwards compatibility is a key priority, and existing code will still default to the current look. I will pass the `themeId` and `particleStyle` into the canvas functions. I\'m starting to think about versioned storage and safe migration.\n\n**Designing Versioned Storage**\n\nI\'m focused on a robust, versioned progression store (`neon_block_profile_v2`) to handle all game data. This needs to safely migrate from the existing v1 localStorage keys. This should include data validation to avoid corruption. Type-checking, and clamping values are essential here.\n\n\n**Validating Data Structures**\n\nI\'m now implementing robust data validation for the progression store. I\'m focusing on non-negative ranges, validating dates using a regex and sanitizing arrays. Unknown IDs are filtered out. I\'m also wrapping `JSON.parse` with `try/catch` to handle potential errors. This should ensure graceful recovery with clean defaults if storage is missing, corrupted, or partially malformed.\n\n\n**Calculating Daily Milestones**\n\nI\'m now implementing the daily milestone logic. The `rewardStreak` increments for consecutive play, and resets on missed days, which drives the `milestoneDay` advancement. I\'ve designed a clear cycle from Day 1 to Day 30, then back to Day 1, ensuring permanent rewards are preserved across cycles, with bonus points, XP, and potentially Neon Shards as Day 1 rewards that can be immediately used! I\'m also ensuring all milestones award the appropriate bonus.\n\n\n**Refining Daily Rewards**\n\nI\'m now refining the daily reward structure to make each milestone distinct and impactful. I\'ve defined clear rewards for each day, including bonus points, XP, and cosmetic unlocks. Duplicate claims are prevented, and existing theme/VFX ownership is considered. If `lastClaimDate === todayKey`, claiming today again returns `{ claimed: false, reason: \'ALREADY_CLAIMED_TODAY\' }` with zero mutations.\n\n\n**Tracking Combo History**\n\nI\'m now designing the combo history system. It records every combo event that is significant, detailing cascading chains, multi-merges, and line clears. This includes a `ComboEvent` object that will be tracked for each combo, including time stamps, mode, multiplier, score, merge & line data, and a descriptive label. I will also be tracking overall statistics such as total combos and highest multiplier.\n\n\n**Designing Combo History System**\n\nI\'m now integrating a history limit. The combo system will now cap the history at the latest 20 events for memory efficiency, including a confirmation dialog for \"Clear History\" to remove the log. I\'m also planning the design of player progression (XP, levels, achievements, and unlockable visual themes) including XP level formulas, and XP awards.\n\n\n**Defining Achievement Logic**\n\nI\'m now detailing ten achievements, including unlocking visual themes, and outlining conditions such as completing a game and reaching Level 5. Several achievements will relate to combos, and others to Daily Challenges. Unlockable themes include `EMERALD_FLUX` at Level 3, `SOLAR_PULSE` at Day 5 or Level 5, `SYNTH_NOVA` at Day 14 or Level 8, and `ASTRAL_GOLD` at Day 30 or Level 12. Players preview, equip, and change these themes in the dashboard!\n\n\n\n**Constructing Dashboard Views**\n\nI\'m now implementing the polished dashboard views, focusing on responsiveness and tablet-friendliness. The overview tab will prominently display player level, rank, XP progress, and a 4-metric stat grid. I\'m also including a Daily Streak and 30-Day Milestone summary with a CTA for rewards. The rewards tab shows a streak indicator and interactive 6-Milestone Track, reward details, and claim button. This includes a Reward Claim Celebration Animation.\n\n\n**Designing Dashboard Features**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Combo History\" tab within the dashboard, aiming for intuitive display of player achievements. This includes combo records (highest multiplier, total combos, highest single-combo score) and a list of the latest 20 combo events. I\'m also planning a confirmation for clearing the history log and working on the design of the \"Achievements & Themes\" tab, with 10 achievement badges. A \"Themes & Effects\" section will include a switcher for equipped themes, and color swatches.\n\nI\'m also ensuring that existing game components, such as core game mechanics, daily challenges, local best scores, and mute preferences will not be altered. This confirms backwards compatibility.\n\n\n**Integrating Canvas Options**\n\nI\'m now integrating the updated `NeonCanvas` component, passing theme IDs, particle styles, and bonus points. I\'ve wired up the `onTurnResolved` callback, decoupling progression from the render loop. I\'m also ensuring existing elements like `DailyChallengeScreen.tsx` are enhanced with quick access buttons, as I test the seamless integration. I\'ve preserved core game features like menus and modes, focusing on new features in the dashboard!\n\n\n\n"
    message_id: "mxAEa7XnB8-sz7IP55a5uAk"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_16692881040182762883"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export const GRID_SIZE = 6;\\nexport const TRAY_SIZE = 3;\\n\\nexport type GameMode = \'CLASSIC\' | \'DAILY\';\\n\\nexport type GameStatus =\\n  | \'TITLE_MENU\'\\n  | \'DAILY_SCREEN\'\\n  | \'DASHBOARD\'\\n  | \'PLAYING\'\\n  | \'PAUSED\'\\n  | \'GAME_OVER\';\\n\\nexport type DashboardTab = \'OVERVIEW\' | \'MILESTONES\' | \'COMBOS\' | \'ACHIEVEMENTS\';\\n\\nexport type FocusZone = \'GRID\' | \'TRAY\';\\n\\nexport type ParticleIntensity = \'LOW\' | \'MEDIUM\' | \'HIGH\';\\n\\nexport type ThemeId =\\n  | \'NEON_CYBER\'\\n  | \'EMERALD_FLUX\'\\n  | \'SOLAR_PULSE\'\\n  | \'SYNTH_NOVA\'\\n  | \'ASTRAL_GOLD\';\\n\\nexport type ParticleStyleId =\\n  | \'CLASSIC_NEON\'\\n  | \'PRISM_BURST\'\\n  | \'SUPERNOVA_TRAIL\';\\n\\nexport type DailyDifficulty = \'STANDARD\' | \'HARD\' | \'EXPERT\';\\n\\nexport type DailyObjectiveType = \'SCORE\' | \'MAX_TILE\' | \'LINES\' | \'MERGES\';\\n\\nexport interface DailyChallengeConfig {\\n  dateKey: string; // Local YYYY-MM-DD\\n  seed: number;\\n  title: string;\\n  difficulty: DailyDifficulty;\\n  objectiveType: DailyObjectiveType;\\n  targetValue: number;\\n  description: string;\\n  rewardShards: number;\\n  starterCells: { r: number; c: number; value: number }[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DailyDayRecord {\\n  dateKey: string;\\n  completed: boolean;\\n  rewardClaimed: boolean;\\n  bestProgress: number;\\n  bestScore: number;\\n  attempts: number;\\n  completedAt?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DailySaveState {\\n  currentStreak: number;\\n  longestStreak: number;\\n  lastCompletedDate: string | null;\\n  totalShards: number;\\n  records: Record<string, DailyDayRecord>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ComboEvent {\\n  id: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  dateKey: string;\\n  mode: GameMode;\\n  multiplier: number;\\n  score: number;\\n  merges: number;\\n  linesCleared: number;\\n  topTile: number;\\n  label: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ComboHistoryState {\\n  highestMultiplier: number;\\n  totalCombos: number;\\n  highestComboScore: number;\\n  events: ComboEvent[];\\n}\\n\\nexport type RewardKind = \'BONUS_POINTS\' | \'THEME\' | \'PARTICLE_FX\' | \'BUNDLE\';\\n\\nexport interface DailyMilestoneDef {\\n  day: 1 | 3 | 5 | 7 | 14 | 30;\\n  title: string;\\n  subtitle: string;\\n  kind: RewardKind;\\n  bonusPoints: number;\\n  xpBonus: number;\\n  themeUnlock?: ThemeId;\\n  particleUnlock?: ParticleStyleId;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface RecentRewardItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  detail: string;\\n  dateKey: string;\\n  kind: \'MILESTONE\' | \'ACHIEVEMENT\' | \'LEVEL\' | \'DAILY_CHALLENGE\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DailyRewardMilestoneState {\\n  rewardStreak: number;\\n  longestRewardStreak: number;\\n  cycleDay: number; // 0..30 (current day reached in the 30-day cycle)\\n  cycleCount: number; // number of completed 30-day cycles\\n  lastClaimDate: string | null;\\n  claimedMilestoneDays: number[]; // milestone days claimed in current cycle\\n  pendingBonusPoints: number;\\n  totalBonusPointsEarned: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport type AchievementId =\\n  | \'FIRST_GAME\'\\n  | \'COMBO_STARTER\'\\n  | \'COMBO_MASTER\'\\n  | \'COMBO_COLLECTOR\'\\n  | \'TILE_256\'\\n  | \'TILE_1024\'\\n  | \'LINE_SWEEPER\'\\n  | \'DAILY_CHAMPION\'\\n  | \'STREAK_WEEK\'\\n  | \'LEVEL_FIVE\';\\n\\nexport interface AchievementDef {\\n  id: AchievementId;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  xpReward: number;\\n  target: number;\\n  metric:\\n    | \'gamesCompleted\'\\n    | \'highestMultiplier\'\\n    | \'totalCombos\'\\n    | \'highestTile\'\\n    | \'totalLinesCleared\'\\n    | \'dailyChallengesCompleted\'\\n    | \'bestStreak\'\\n    | \'level\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PlayerLifetimeStats {\\n  gamesCompleted: number;\\n  totalScoreEarned: number;\\n  highestTile: number;\\n  totalMerges: number;\\n  totalLinesCleared: number;\\n  dailyChallengesCompleted: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PlayerProfileState {\\n  version: number;\\n  xp: number;\\n  level: number;\\n  selectedTheme: ThemeId;\\n  selectedParticleStyle: ParticleStyleId;\\n  unlockedThemes: ThemeId[];\\n  unlockedParticleStyles: ParticleStyleId[];\\n  unlockedAchievements: AchievementId[];\\n  milestones: DailyRewardMilestoneState;\\n  comboHistory: ComboHistoryState;\\n  lifetime: PlayerLifetimeStats;\\n  recentRewards: RecentRewardItem[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GridCoord {\\n  r: number;\\n  c: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CellOffset {\\n  dr: number;\\n  dc: number;\\n  value: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface BlockPiece {\\n  id: string;\\n  shapeName: string;\\n  cells: CellOffset[];\\n  width: number;\\n  height: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface BoardTile {\\n  id: number;\\n  value: number;\\n  scale: number;\\n  targetScale: number;\\n  offsetX: number;\\n  offsetY: number;\\n  flash: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport type GridMatrix = (BoardTile | null)[][];\\n\\nexport interface MergeStep {\\n  fromCells: GridCoord[];\\n  targetCell: GridCoord;\\n  oldValue: number;\\n  newValue: number;\\n  comboDepth: number;\\n  points: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LineClearStep {\\n  rows: number[];\\n  cols: number[];\\n  clearedCells: { r: number; c: number; value: number }[];\\n  points: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PlacementPreview {\\n  valid: boolean;\\n  anchorRow: number;\\n  anchorCol: number;\\n  targetCells: GridCoord[];\\n  willMergeCells: GridCoord[];\\n  willClearRows: number[];\\n  willClearCols: number[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TurnResolution {\\n  placedCells: GridCoord[];\\n  placementPoints: number;\\n  mergeSteps: MergeStep[];\\n  lineClearStep: LineClearStep | null;\\n  totalPointsGained: number;\\n  maxComboDepth: number;\\n  newMaxTile: number;\\n  refilledTray: boolean;\\n  isGameOver: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GameStats {\\n  score: number;\\n  bestScore: number;\\n  maxTile: number;\\n  mergesCount: number;\\n  linesCleared: number;\\n  bestCombo: number;\\n  turnsPlayed: number;\\n  isNewBest: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport type ParticleShape = \'circle\' | \'spark\' | \'diamond\';\\n\\nexport interface Particle {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  vx: number;\\n  vy: number;\\n  size: number;\\n  color: string;\\n  alpha: number;\\n  life: number;\\n  maxLife: number;\\n  shape: ParticleShape;\\n  gravity: number;\\n  drag: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FireworkRocket {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  vx: number;\\n  vy: number;\\n  targetY: number;\\n  color: string;\\n  trailTimer: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ShockwaveRing {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  radius: number;\\n  maxRadius: number;\\n  color: string;\\n  alpha: number;\\n  life: number;\\n  maxLife: number;\\n  lineWidth: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LineBeam {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  w: number;\\n  h: number;\\n  color: string;\\n  life: number;\\n  maxLife: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FloatingText {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  vy: number;\\n  text: string;\\n  subtext?: string;\\n  color: string;\\n  life: number;\\n  maxLife: number;\\n  scale: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MergeGhostTile {\\n  fromX: number;\\n  fromY: number;\\n  toX: number;\\n  toY: number;\\n  size: number;\\n  value: number;\\n  progress: number;\\n  duration: number;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Extend NEON BLOCK types for 30-day Daily Reward Milestones, Combo History, Player Progression (XP/Levels/Achievements/Themes/Particle Styles), and Dashboard\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/game/types.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating game types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update game types\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\247r\n\244r\001i\024}\023!J\005\214\263\370\f\035p\030B$\311@*\371\022\264\355\223{\254\362z\361@E\n\033\024\206?i\336\332U\272\\\024\2659\272\021\002\337\350l\3501(\214G\267\231\325\033\363#\342\237\363\307\241\032\036\006\352\027\267\201\375\3705M\260eO\026\223\245\025K\301jr\302\246 \344\005\207\351\021\202W\241u%Z\212\322\232.\272X\3062\350\316r\033\277\252\017\004\246\374c\b\3400h\216T\274:\250U\236]q=<,\214\346\227<\n\323\2340\373\310{Tzj?C%}L\201\n\024\276n\334b\222\224\177\363\327m\253\202\006\000c\274\237\240\323d\375]\025M\363\177x\313\233\025\262\312\246\023\270\335E\353|\257#Q \275M9%t\305\036\016\204)`\033\271 \236\344\250\246\033{\211\352\016\214\322\033\310\210A\265\254\300\245\376Z\315\034\025\220\002I\324.\275\327\253V\367X<\355X]\326\021\202sm\344T\a\246C\310q\347\177WWQByZ\217At3\321\263J\221\270\213\374\377\243H9\361\033\264\024\353.\345\2010s\027\021x\307Te\372\276YG\026\205<\257\022\312A\315Xo~-E)\267\365\236\360\304\r#\206\251\256\341dX$`\232=y\313\277\337\217\364\035\370\324\022$>\357,\361e\003\'[+c\355\206\275\033\fx(\216\262 \025eB\030@r?\201\t?\336v\021.\0055\0360\2469\202\022o?\353P\240<\311ei\321H\364\243+\270\214i\232X\364x\232\n\226\242*\266\"\307\\\006/b*\326m\355\0029\350v\002\360\025\221\3173Ab\245\363Si\304x,\003\025\252m\356\355\207\327\223\363\264\027\t\366?\352\241Q\333\r\313\213\0367\305\230d\265n\207}\306\177\a\335G\3304\b0e\355\205\225)\246,\343\345\0217~8\352}\001\303\363\236M\372\333\307\337\213W\000\037\315\n)?mZMD_|\375\246j\204\345\206h\026@Nd\313\006x\'\302\253\032\302}\270\337\272\224\300\261\243ew\216g\036M\3479\370\220\333\270+\230!A\262-\326\n\006\335\215H\327x\337\tJ\306a\260$\367\327\261\035\325a?-w]\336ux\2631)W\367F\005\372\230T_\326~\336N\360\376T\200\246\221\346{\360\2369\3635\3757V\203\256\346\016H\377\376\304\354U\264\277Y\367\254B!LP\340!\215VZ\360\213\232\a\207\371?b\323\215\335\376\225\355\247I#\216\234\212F\254\374\300R\272\2546\227\214\367|,\rm\360\220 6|\275~\021\350\231