  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nUpgrade the existing offline HTML5 Canvas puzzle game **NEON BLOCK** (React + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + Vite) into a premium arcade puzzle experience **without rebuilding or removing any existing gameplay mechanics, scoring, controls, animations, particle effects, Daily Challenge, or saved data**.\n\nRequested systems to add:\n1. **Daily Reward Milestones**: 30-day daily reward progression with milestone rewards at Days **1, 3, 5, 7, 14, and 30** (bonus points, cosmetic themes, particle effects), reward claim animation, streak indicator + milestone progress bar, local persistence, duplicate claim prevention, and proper date-change / streak-reset handling.\n2. **Combo History**: Record every significant combo event; track highest combo multiplier, total combos, highest single-combo score; display latest 20 combo events; include combo statistics & personal records; add a Clear History option with confirmation (no `window.confirm`).\n3. **Player Progression**: XP and player levels; award XP for completed games, combos, and Daily Challenges; achievement badges; unlockable visual themes; save all progression locally.\n4. **Dashboard**: Polished statistics dashboard showing current player level, XP progress bar, daily streak, reward milestones, best combo, total combos, achievement collection, and recently unlocked rewards.\n5. **Technical Requirements**: 100% offline (no external APIs/CDNs/accounts/cloud DBs/new deps), versioned `localStorage` with safe migration and validation, graceful handling of missing/corrupted storage, consistent local device calendar date (`YYYY-MM-DD`), duplicate reward prevention, bounded animations/memory usage, responsive on Android tablets.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Skills Read\n- `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/4_games_2d_casual.md`\n\n### Completed Code Edits (NOT YET COMPILED, LINTED, OR TESTED)\nAll planned implementation files for this turn have been written:\n- `/src/game/types.ts` \342\200\224 Extended with `GameStatus` (`\'DASHBOARD\'`), `DashboardTab`, `ThemeId` (`NEON_CYBER | EMERALD_FLUX | SOLAR_PULSE | SYNTH_NOVA | ASTRAL_GOLD`), `ParticleStyleId` (`CLASSIC_NEON | PRISM_BURST | SUPERNOVA_TRAIL`), `ComboEvent`, `ComboHistoryState`, `DailyMilestoneDef`, `DailyRewardMilestoneState`, `AchievementId`, `AchievementDef`, `PlayerLifetimeStats`, `RecentRewardItem`, `PlayerProfileState`.\n- `/src/game/themes.ts` (new) \342\200\224 Defines 5 unlockable visual board themes (`VISUAL_THEMES`, `THEME_LIST`) and 3 unlockable particle effect styles (`PARTICLE_STYLES`, `PARTICLE_STYLE_LIST`) with swatches, backdrop gradients, board frames, slot colors, beams, waves, motes, and combo palettes.\n- `/src/game/palette.ts` \342\200\224 Updated `getTilePalette(value, themeId = \'NEON_CYBER\')` to support all 5 themes while preserving default `NEON_CYBER` behavior.\n- `/src/game/progression.ts` (new) \342\200\224 Versioned `localStorage` store (`neon_block_profile_v2`, schema `version: 2`) with:\n  - `validateAndMigrateProfile` (validates types/ranges/dates, sanitizes arrays, migrates from v1 `neon_block_daily_v1` & `neon_block_best_score_v1`, safely recovers from corrupted JSON).\n  - 30-day Daily Reward Milestones (`DAILY_MILESTONES` at days 1, 3, 5, 7, 14, 30), `getDailyMilestoneStatus`, `claimDailyMilestoneReward` (strictly prevents duplicate claims on same local date or same cycle milestone, handles clock rollback & missed-day streak reset, cycles 30\342\206\2221 cleanly while preserving permanent unlocks), `consumePendingBonusPoints`.\n  - Combo History (`recordTurnProgression`, caps `events` to latest 20 via `MAX_COMBO_HISTORY_EVENTS = 20`, tracks `highestMultiplier`, `totalCombos`, `highestComboScore`, `clearComboHistory`).\n  - Player Progression (`xpRequiredForLevel`, `computeLevelFromTotalXp`, `getPlayerRankTitle`, `applyLevelAndThemeUnlocks`, 10 `ACHIEVEMENTS`, `evaluateAchievements`, `recordGameCompletionProgression`, `recordDailyChallengeVictoryProgression`).\n- `/src/game/audio.ts` \342\200\224 Added `playRewardClaim()` and `playLevelUp()` procedural Web Audio API cues.\n- `/src/game/renderer.ts` \342\200\224 Threaded `themeId` through `RenderFrameState`, `drawNeonTile`, `drawBlockPiece`, `createAmbientMotes`, and `renderNeonCanvas` (themed backdrop, board frame, slots, beams, prediction rails, and tiles).\n- `/src/components/NeonCanvas.tsx` \342\200\224 Added `themeId`, `particleStyle`, `onTurnResolved` props and `startingBonusPoints` in `StartGameOptions`; applied active theme & particle FX styles (`PRISM_BURST`, `SUPERNOVA_TRAIL`) while respecting particle budget caps and `prefers-reduced-motion`; emits `onTurnResolved(res)` after every valid placement.\n- `/src/components/DashboardScreen.tsx` (new) \342\200\224 Dedicated 4-tab Dashboard (`OVERVIEW`, `MILESTONES`, `COMBOS`, `ACHIEVEMENTS`) with Level/XP progress bar, 4-column KPI strip, 30-day milestone progress bar & 6-milestone cards, animated Reward Claim Celebration modal, latest 20 combo events + inline 2-step Clear History confirmation (no `window.confirm`), Achievement collection with progress bars, and Visual Theme / Particle FX gallery with Equip buttons.\n- `/src/components/DailyChallengeScreen.tsx` \342\200\224 Added optional `onOpenMilestones` button linking directly to the 30-Day Rewards tab.\n- `/src/index.css` \342\200\224 Added `@keyframes rewardPop` (disabled automatically under `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`).\n- `/src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 Integrated `PlayerProfileState`, `DashboardScreen`, turn combo/XP tracking, game completion XP, Daily Challenge victory XP, starting bonus point consumption on next Classic game, Level/XP bar in landscape sidebar, Dashboard button in Title Menu / Sidebar / Portrait Header / Pause / Game Over, and Escape/D-pad navigation.\n\n### Existing Preserved Files (Untouched in This Turn)\n- `/src/game/engine.ts` \342\200\224 Preserves 6\303\2276 placement, collision, 3+ cluster merge, cascading chains, row/col line clears, game-over detection, `neon_block_best_score_v1`, `neon_block_muted_v1`.\n- `/src/game/daily.ts` \342\200\224 Preserves local date keys (`getLocalDateKey`, `offsetLocalDateKey`), deterministic daily challenge generation, `neon_block_daily_v1`, `neon_block_particle_intensity_v1`.\n- `/src/components/NeonLogo.tsx`, `/index.html`, `/metadata.json`, `/package.json`, `/vite.config.ts`.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- Existing `localStorage` keys from previous builds MUST remain untouched and backwards-compatible: `neon_block_best_score_v1`, `neon_block_muted_v1`, `neon_block_daily_v1`, `neon_block_particle_intensity_v1`. The new profile store uses `neon_block_profile_v2` with `version: 2`.\n- Tailwind CSS v4 is configured via `@import \"tailwindcss\";` in `src/index.css`. No external fonts or CDNs may be added (offline requirement).\n- `window.alert` / `window.confirm` / `window.open` are banned in the AI Studio iframe runtime; Clear History confirmation is implemented as an inline UI confirmation step.\n- `NeonCanvas` runs an isolated 60fps `requestAnimationFrame` loop using refs so React state updates in `App.tsx` never interrupt canvas rendering.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Earlier turn: `tsc --noEmit` flagged TS2322 in `src/game/engine.ts` line 585 (`tray.every((item) => item === null)` narrowed `tray` to `null[]`). Fixed by assigning `const mutableTray: (BlockPiece | null)[] = tray;`.\n- Current turn: One transient `INTERNAL` error occurred when calling `view_file` on `src/game/audio.ts`; immediate retry succeeded.\n- No build/lint/test commands have been executed yet for the current turn\'s edits.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- All source edits for the current upgrade are written to disk, ready for compilation, TypeScript linting, and thorough automated unit/regression testing via `npx tsx`.\n- Dev server runs on port 3000 via Vite (`npm run dev`). No background tasks are currently running.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Run Build & TypeScript Lint Together**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to verify zero TypeScript or Vite build errors across all newly created/edited files (`types.ts`, `themes.ts`, `palette.ts`, `progression.ts`, `audio.ts`, `renderer.ts`, `NeonCanvas.tsx`, `DashboardScreen.tsx`, `DailyChallengeScreen.tsx`, `App.tsx`). Fix any issues found (max 3 attempts).\n2. **Run Comprehensive Automated Verification Suite via `run_command` (`npx tsx -e \"...\"`)**:\n   Test all new and existing features end-to-end:\n   - **Daily Reward Milestones (30-day progression)**:\n     - Verify claims across consecutive local dates (`2026-11-01` \342\206\222 `2026-11-30`) hit exact milestones on Days `1, 3, 5, 7, 14, 30` (bonus points, `SOLAR_PULSE` theme on Day 5, `PRISM_BURST` FX on Day 7, `SYNTH_NOVA` theme on Day 14, `ASTRAL_GOLD` + `SUPERNOVA_TRAIL` on Day 30).\n     - Verify duplicate claim prevention on the same local calendar date (`claimed === false`, `reason === \'ALREADY_CLAIMED_TODAY\'`, zero extra points/XP/streak).\n     - Verify clock rollback (`todayKey < lastClaimDate`) blocks duplicate claim.\n     - Verify missed day (`+2 days`) resets `effectiveStreak` and `effectiveCycleDay` to 0 and restarts at Day 1 on next claim while preserving permanently unlocked themes/FX.\n     - Verify Day 30 \342\206\222 Day 31 rolls over cleanly into a new 30-day cycle without duplicating already-owned cosmetic unlocks.\n   - **Combo History**:\n     - Record 25 significant combo events via `recordTurnProgression` and verify `events.length === 20` (capped to latest 20), `totalCombos === 25`, `highestMultiplier` and `highestComboScore` tracked accurately.\n     - Verify `clearComboHistory` resets `events`, `totalCombos`, `highestMultiplier`, and `highestComboScore`.\n   - **Player Progression (XP, Levels, Achievements, Themes)**:\n     - Verify XP awards on combos, completed games (`recordGameCompletionProgression`), and Daily Challenge victories (`recordDailyChallengeVictoryProgression`).\n     - Verify level-up calculation (`computeLevelFromTotalXp`) and Level 3 `EMERALD_FLUX` theme unlock.\n     - Verify achievements unlock cleanly (e.g., `FIRST_GAME`, `COMBO_STARTER`, `COMBO_MASTER`, `TILE_256`, `DAILY_CHAMPION`, `STREAK_WEEK`, `LEVEL_FIVE`) and never double-award XP.\n   - **Versioned Storage Validation & Corruption Recovery**:\n     - Test `validateAndMigrateProfile` with `null`, corrupted/partial objects, negative/NaN numbers, invalid dates, unknown theme/particle/achievement IDs, oversized combo event arrays (>20), and v1 legacy migration data.\n   - **Existing Core Gameplay & Daily Challenge Regression Check**:\n     - Verify placement, collision, 3+ cascading merges, line clears, game-over detection, Daily Challenge deterministic seeding & duplicate-reward guard, theme-aware `getTilePalette`, and responsive `computeCanvasLayout` across Android tablet & mobile viewports (`1280x800`, `1024x600`, `390x844`).\n3. **Final Verification & Concise User Summary**:\n   - If any code fixes were needed during testing, re-run `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` together before finishing.\n   - Present a concise, scannable overview of the completed upgrade (no hype or raw file paths).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Preserve all existing functionality**: Classic & Daily gameplay, scoring, touch/mouse/keyboard/Fire TV D-pad controls, particle effects, Web Audio SFX, reduced-motion support, and existing `localStorage` records.\n- **Strictly offline**: Zero external APIs, CDNs, cloud databases, or extra npm dependencies.\n- **UI/UX standards**: Follow `frontend-design` rules \342\200\224 zero static pill enclosures on metadata, `tabular-nums` for numbers, `>= 44px` touch/D-pad targets, no decorative pulsing dots, single-line controls, smooth `<= 200ms` transitions, no `window.alert`/`window.confirm`.\n- **Final check**: Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together on the final build check before responding to the user.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 108
