  planner_response {
    response: "**NEON BLOCK** has been upgraded with full progression, reward milestones, combo analytics, and a dedicated statistics dashboard while preserving all existing gameplay, scoring, controls, particle effects, Web Audio SFX, Daily Challenges, and local records.\n\n### What Was Added\n\n1. **30-Day Daily Reward Milestones**\n   - Daily check-in progression across a 30-day cycle using the device\'s local calendar date (`YYYY-MM-DD`).\n   - Milestone rewards at **Days 1, 3, 5, 7, 14, and 30**, granting starting bonus points (automatically applied to your next Classic run), XP boosts, unlockable board themes (*Solar Pulse*, *Synth Nova*, *Astral Gold*), and particle FX styles (*Prism Burst*, *Supernova Trail*).\n   - Reward claim celebration modal with Web Audio chime and reduced-motion support, streak indicator, and 30-day milestone progress bar.\n   - Strict duplicate claim prevention on the same date (including clock rollback protection), automatic streak/cycle reset on missed days while keeping permanent unlocks, and clean rollover after Day 30.\n\n2. **Combo History & Personal Records**\n   - Automatically records every significant combo event (cascading chains, multi-merges, fusion clears, and multi-line sweeps) across Classic and Daily modes.\n   - Tracks highest combo multiplier, total combos, and highest single-combo score, displaying the latest **20** combo events with mode, date, merges, lines cleared, and top tile details.\n   - Includes a two-step inline **Clear History** confirmation flow.\n\n3. **Player Progression, Achievements & Unlockable Themes**\n   - XP and player leveling system with rank titles, awarding XP for combos, completed runs, Daily Challenge victories, milestones, and achievements.\n   - **10 achievement badges** tracking gameplay, combo mastery, high tiles, line clears, daily challenges, streaks, and player level\342\200\224each granting one-time XP rewards.\n   - **5 visual board themes** (*Neon Cyber*, *Emerald Flux*, *Solar Pulse*, *Synth Nova*, *Astral Gold*) and **3 particle effect styles** (*Classic Neon*, *Prism Burst*, *Supernova Trail*) that update the HTML5 Canvas board, tile palettes, beams, and bursts live.\n\n4. **Statistics Dashboard**\n   - Accessible from the title menu, gameplay HUD, pause menu, game-over screen, and Daily Challenge screen.\n   - Organized into four tablet-friendly tabs (**Overview**, **30-Day Rewards**, **Combo History**, and **Achievements & Themes**) showing player level, XP progress bar, daily streak, milestone progress, combo records, achievement progress bars, recently unlocked rewards, and theme/particle customization.\n\n5. **Offline Storage & Reliability**\n   - Fully offline with versioned `localStorage` persistence, safe migration from previous saved high scores and Daily Challenge data, strict field validation, and automatic recovery from missing or corrupted storage.\n   - Verified via TypeScript linting, production bundling, and automated tests covering 30-day milestone cycles, duplicate/rollback/streak-reset edge cases, 20-event combo history capping, progression/achievement unlocks, corrupted storage recovery, core gameplay/Daily Challenge rules, and Android tablet/mobile layouts."
