  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Interface Navigation**\n\nI\'ve been examining the UI navigation during gameplay, specifically focusing on the HUD. Lines 660-1025 were particularly useful. I found a clear pattern: the sidebar and portrait header both display Dashboard, Daily Challenge, and Rules buttons during the `PLAYING` state. I\'ll need to explore the connections of those buttons.\n\n\n**Refining Button Functionality**\n\nI\'ve clarified the Daily Challenge button\'s behavior. Now, going from PLAYING to DAILY_SCREEN, and pressing Escape, correctly goes to PAUSED (then resuming the game), thanks to the menu history stack. I need to update control hints in lines 998 & 1132 to reflect this new functionality with `H Help \302\267 Esc Back`, and also update the keyboard section in the How to Play modal! I\'m going to double check lines 1134-1155 in `NeonCanvas.tsx` for possible necessary tweaks.\n\n\n"
