  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating App.tsx**\n\nI\'m now integrating the navigation logic into `/src/App.tsx`. I\'ve imported the necessary navigation state and view-transition functions. Currently, the focus is on replacing specific status-related variables, preparing the App component for enhanced game flow and navigation control.\n\n\n**Refining Navigation Flow**\n\nI\'m refining the navigation flow. The `goBackToPreviousView` function now triggers a navigation back, playing a select sound, and refocusing the game board if the new state is \'PLAYING\'. Daily and Dashboard screen \"back\" actions now call this function. A new global keydown handler ignores certain key combinations and editable fields, and the global `\'H\'` or `\'?\'` now consistently toggles the help menu across all views.\n\n\n**Implementing Global Shortcuts**\n\nI\'ve implemented global shortcuts. \'Escape\', \'Backspace\', or \'GoBack\' now uniformly close the help menu if open, or call `goBackToPreviousView()` otherwise. \'M\' consistently toggles sound globally across all views, replacing the previous `NeonCanvas` implementation. Also, the \'P\' and \'MediaPlayPause\' keys now reliably pause or resume the game while in the playing or paused states.\n\n\n**Enhancing Help Menu**\n\nI\'m now enhancing the help menu functionality in `/src/App.tsx`. I\'ve ensured `Enter`, `Space`, and similar keys maintain their functionality in `TITLE_MENU` and `GAME_OVER`. The `handleHudButtonKeyDown` has been updated to prevent `Escape` from being swallowed during gameplay when a HUD button is focused. Also, the `<NeonCanvas />` component now receives a dynamically updated status, softly dimming during help, but preserving state. Finally, the help modal now renders consistently across various views as an overlay, and the modal handles its own keyboard controls, like `Esc` to return.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "rRkEa_H6HqH8-sAP6fK9-QU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_11602083879278923972"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Wire up global H key How to Play modal overlay trigger and full Escape previous-menu navigation stack across all views\", \"Instruction\":\"Integrate navigation history stack, global H shortcut for How to Play overlay, unified Escape back-navigation across all views, and non-unmounting Help overlay rendering in App.tsx.\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":55, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import {\\n  INITIAL_NAV_STATE,\\n  NavigationState,\\n  enterGameOverView,\\n  navigateBack,\\n  navigateToView,\\n  startGameView,\\n  togglePauseView,\\n} from \'./game/navigation\';\\nimport {\\n  ClaimMilestoneResult,\\n  claimDailyMilestoneReward,\\n  clearComboHistory,\\n  computeLevelFromTotalXp,\\n  consumePendingBonusPoints,\\n  getDailyMilestoneStatus,\\n  getPlayerRankTitle,\\n  loadPlayerProfile,\\n  recordDailyChallengeVictoryProgression,\\n  recordGameCompletionProgression,\\n  recordTurnProgression,\\n  savePlayerProfile,\\n} from \'./game/progression\';\", \"StartLine\":38, \"TargetContent\":\"import {\\n  ClaimMilestoneResult,\\n  claimDailyMilestoneReward,\\n  clearComboHistory,\\n  computeLevelFromTotalXp,\\n  consumePendingBonusPoints,\\n  getDailyMilestoneStatus,\\n  getPlayerRankTitle,\\n  loadPlayerProfile,\\n  recordDailyChallengeVictoryProgression,\\n  recordGameCompletionProgression,\\n  recordTurnProgression,\\n  savePlayerProfile,\\n} from \'./game/progression\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":81, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [navState, setNavState] = useState<NavigationState>(INITIAL_NAV_STATE);\\n  const status = navState.status;\\n  const navStateRef = useRef<NavigationState>(navState);\\n  navStateRef.current = navState;\\n  const [dashboardTab, setDashboardTab] = useState<DashboardTab>(\'OVERVIEW\');\\n  const [gameMode, setGameMode] = useState<GameMode>(\'CLASSIC\');\\n  const [showHelp, setShowHelp] = useState(false);\", \"StartLine\":73, \"TargetContent\":\"  const [status, setStatus] = useState<GameStatus>(\'TITLE_MENU\');\\n  const [dashboardTab, setDashboardTab] = useState<DashboardTab>(\'OVERVIEW\');\\n  const [previousNonDashStatus, setPreviousNonDashStatus] =\\n    useState<GameStatus>(\'TITLE_MENU\');\\n  const [gameMode, setGameMode] = useState<GameMode>(\'CLASSIC\');\\n  const [showHelp, setShowHelp] = useState(false);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":372, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    setNavState((prev) => startGameView(prev));\\n    canvasHandleRef.current?.startNewGame({\\n      startingBonusPoints: bonusPoints,\\n    });\\n    window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n    }, 30);\\n  }, [commitProfile]);\\n\\n  const startDailyGame = useCallback(() => {\\n    const currentKey = getLocalDateKey();\\n    if (currentKey !== todayKeyRef.current) {\\n      setTodayKey(currentKey);\\n    }\\n    const freshChallenge = generateDailyChallenge(currentKey);\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setGameMode(\'DAILY\');\\n    setDailyRunCompleted(false);\\n    setDailyRunShards(0);\\n    setLastRunXp(0);\\n    setToastBanner(\'\');\\n\\n    const updated = recordDailyAttempt(\\n      dailyStateRef.current,\\n      freshChallenge.dateKey\\n    );\\n    dailyStateRef.current = updated;\\n    setDailyState(updated);\\n\\n    setNavState((prev) => startGameView(prev));\\n    canvasHandleRef.current?.startNewGame({ dailyChallenge: freshChallenge });\\n    window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n    }, 30);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const restartCurrentMode = useCallback(() => {\\n    if (gameModeRef.current === \'DAILY\') {\\n      startDailyGame();\\n    } else {\\n      startClassicGame();\\n    }\\n  }, [startClassicGame, startDailyGame]);\\n\\n  const openDailyScreen = useCallback(() => {\\n    const currentKey = getLocalDateKey();\\n    if (currentKey !== todayKeyRef.current) {\\n      setTodayKey(currentKey);\\n    }\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setNavState((prev) => navigateToView(prev, \'DAILY_SCREEN\'));\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const openDashboard = useCallback((tab: DashboardTab = \'OVERVIEW\') => {\\n    const currentKey = getLocalDateKey();\\n    if (currentKey !== todayKeyRef.current) {\\n      setTodayKey(currentKey);\\n    }\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setDashboardTab(tab);\\n    setNavState((prev) => navigateToView(prev, \'DASHBOARD\'));\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const goBackToPreviousView = useCallback(() => {\\n    const current = navStateRef.current;\\n    const next = navigateBack(current);\\n    if (next.status === current.status && next.history.length === current.history.length) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setNavState(next);\\n    if (next.status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n      window.setTimeout(() => {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }, 30);\\n    }\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const openHelp = useCallback(() => {\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(true);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const closeHelp = useCallback(() => {\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    if (navStateRef.current.status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n      window.setTimeout(() => {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }, 30);\\n    }\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const toggleHelp = useCallback(() => {\\n    if (showHelp) {\\n      closeHelp();\\n    } else {\\n      openHelp();\\n    }\\n  }, [showHelp, openHelp, closeHelp]);\", \"StartLine\":287, \"TargetContent\":\"    setStatus(\'PLAYING\');\\n    canvasHandleRef.current?.startNewGame({\\n      startingBonusPoints: bonusPoints,\\n    });\\n    window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n    }, 30);\\n  }, [commitProfile]);\\n\\n  const startDailyGame = useCallback(() => {\\n    const currentKey = getLocalDateKey();\\n    if (currentKey !== todayKeyRef.current) {\\n      setTodayKey(currentKey);\\n    }\\n    const freshChallenge = generateDailyChallenge(currentKey);\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setGameMode(\'DAILY\');\\n    setDailyRunCompleted(false);\\n    setDailyRunShards(0);\\n    setLastRunXp(0);\\n    setToastBanner(\'\');\\n\\n    const updated = recordDailyAttempt(\\n      dailyStateRef.current,\\n      freshChallenge.dateKey\\n    );\\n    dailyStateRef.current = updated;\\n    setDailyState(updated);\\n\\n    setStatus(\'PLAYING\');\\n    canvasHandleRef.current?.startNewGame({ dailyChallenge: freshChallenge });\\n    window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n    }, 30);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const restartCurrentMode = useCallback(() => {\\n    if (gameModeRef.current === \'DAILY\') {\\n      startDailyGame();\\n    } else {\\n      startClassicGame();\\n    }\\n  }, [startClassicGame, startDailyGame]);\\n\\n  const openDailyScreen = useCallback(() => {\\n    const currentKey = getLocalDateKey();\\n    if (currentKey !== todayKeyRef.current) {\\n      setTodayKey(currentKey);\\n    }\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setStatus(\'DAILY_SCREEN\');\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const openDashboard = useCallback(\\n    (tab: DashboardTab = \'OVERVIEW\') => {\\n      const currentKey = getLocalDateKey();\\n      if (currentKey !== todayKeyRef.current) {\\n        setTodayKey(currentKey);\\n      }\\n      neonAudio.unlock();\\n      neonAudio.playSelect();\\n      setShowHelp(false);\\n      if (status !== \'DASHBOARD\') {\\n        setPreviousNonDashStatus(status === \'PLAYING\' ? \'PAUSED\' : status);\\n      }\\n      setDashboardTab(tab);\\n      setStatus(\'DASHBOARD\');\\n    },\\n    [status]\\n  );\\n\\n  const closeDashboard = useCallback(() => {\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setStatus(\\n      previousNonDashStatus === \'DASHBOARD\'\\n        ? \'TITLE_MENU\'\\n        : previousNonDashStatus\\n    );\\n  }, [previousNonDashStatus]);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":630, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const pauseGame = useCallback(() => {\\n    const current = navStateRef.current;\\n    if (current.status !== \'PLAYING\' && current.status !== \'PAUSED\') return;\\n    neonAudio.unlock();\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    const next = togglePauseView(current);\\n    setNavState(next);\\n    if (next.status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n      window.setTimeout(() => {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }, 30);\\n    }\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const handleGameOver = useCallback(\\n    (finalStats: GameStats) => {\\n      setStats(finalStats);\\n      if (finalStats.bestScore > bestScore) {\\n        setBestScore(finalStats.bestScore);\\n        saveBestScore(finalStats.bestScore);\\n      }\\n      if (finalStats.isNewBest) {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.triggerFireworks(5);\\n      }\\n\\n      const progRes = recordGameCompletionProgression(\\n        profileRef.current,\\n        finalStats,\\n        dailyStateRef.current.longestStreak,\\n        todayKeyRef.current\\n      );\\n      commitProfile(progRes.profile);\\n      setLastRunXp(progRes.xpAwarded);\\n      if (progRes.leveledUpTo) {\\n        window.setTimeout(() => neonAudio.playLevelUp(), 260);\\n      }\\n\\n      setNavState((prev) => enterGameOverView(prev));\\n    },\\n    [bestScore, commitProfile]\\n  );\\n\\n  const returnToTitle = useCallback(() => {\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setToastBanner(\'\');\\n    setNavState(INITIAL_NAV_STATE);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Auto-focus primary CTA when modal states transition for seamless D-pad/Keyboard UX\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (showHelp) {\\n      closeHelpBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'TITLE_MENU\') {\\n      startBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'PAUSED\') {\\n      resumeBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'GAME_OVER\') {\\n      playAgainBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    }\\n  }, [status, showHelp]);\\n\\n  // Global keyboard shortcuts for How to Play (\'H\'), Escape back-navigation, Pause, Sound & Menus\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const onKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      if (e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey || e.altKey) return;\\n\\n      const target = e.target as HTMLElement | null;\\n      if (\\n        target &&\\n        (target.tagName === \'INPUT\' ||\\n          target.tagName === \'TEXTAREA\' ||\\n          target.tagName === \'SELECT\' ||\\n          target.isContentEditable)\\n      ) {\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      const key = e.key;\\n\\n      // Dedicated \'H\' key trigger to toggle the \'How to Play\' help menu modal overlay from any view\\n      if (key === \'h\' || key === \'H\' || key === \'?\') {\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        toggleHelp();\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      // Mute toggle available across all views\\n      if (key === \'m\' || key === \'M\') {\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        toggleMute();\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      // When How to Play modal is open, Escape returns cleanly to the underlying view\\n      if (showHelp) {\\n        if (key === \'Escape\' || key === \'GoBack\' || key === \'Backspace\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          closeHelp();\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      // Escape returns to the previous menu state across all views (and pauses active gameplay)\\n      if (\\n        key === \'Escape\' ||\\n        key === \'GoBack\' ||\\n        (key === \'Backspace\' && status !== \'PLAYING\')\\n      ) {\\n        if (status !== \'TITLE_MENU\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          goBackToPreviousView();\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      // Pause / Resume shortcuts\\n      if (key === \'p\' || key === \'P\' || key === \'MediaPlayPause\') {\\n        if (status === \'PLAYING\' || status === \'PAUSED\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          pauseGame();\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'TITLE_MENU\') {\\n        const activeAction = document.activeElement?.getAttribute(\'data-action\');\\n        if (\\n          (key === \'Enter\' ||\\n            key === \' \' ||\\n            key === \'Select\' ||\\n            key === \'DPadCenter\') &&\\n          activeAction !== \'help\' &&\\n          activeAction !== \'daily\' &&\\n          activeAction !== \'dashboard\'\\n        ) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          startClassicGame();\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'GAME_OVER\') {\\n        const activeAction = document.activeElement?.getAttribute(\'data-action\');\\n        if (\\n          (key === \'Enter\' ||\\n            key === \' \' ||\\n            key === \'Select\' ||\\n            key === \'DPadCenter\') &&\\n          activeAction !== \'menu\' &&\\n          activeAction !== \'daily\' &&\\n          activeAction !== \'dashboard\'\\n        ) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          restartCurrentMode();\\n        }\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n  }, [\\n    status,\\n    showHelp,\\n    toggleHelp,\\n    closeHelp,\\n    goBackToPreviousView,\\n    startClassicGame,\\n    restartCurrentMode,\\n    pauseGame,\\n    toggleMute,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  // Allow D-pad navigation across HUD buttons and back to Canvas\\n  const handleHudButtonKeyDown = (\\n    e: React.KeyboardEvent<HTMLButtonElement>,\\n    idx: number\\n  ) => {\\n    const key = e.key;\\n    if (key === \'ArrowDown\' || key === \'ArrowRight\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      if (idx < hudButtonRefs.current.length - 1) {\\n        hudButtonRefs.current[idx + 1]?.focus();\\n      } else if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }\\n    } else if (key === \'ArrowUp\' || key === \'ArrowLeft\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      if (idx > 0) {\\n        hudButtonRefs.current[idx - 1]?.focus();\\n      } else if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  };\", \"StartLine\":440, \"TargetContent\":\"  const pauseGame = useCallback(() => {\\n    if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n      neonAudio.playSelect();\\n      setStatus(\'PAUSED\');\\n    } else if (status === \'PAUSED\') {\\n      neonAudio.playSelect();\\n      setStatus(\'PLAYING\');\\n      window.setTimeout(() => {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }, 30);\\n    }\\n  }, [status]);\\n\\n  const handleGameOver = useCallback(\\n    (finalStats: GameStats) => {\\n      setStats(finalStats);\\n      if (finalStats.bestScore > bestScore) {\\n        setBestScore(finalStats.bestScore);\\n        saveBestScore(finalStats.bestScore);\\n      }\\n      if (finalStats.isNewBest) {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.triggerFireworks(5);\\n      }\\n\\n      const progRes = recordGameCompletionProgression(\\n        profileRef.current,\\n        finalStats,\\n        dailyStateRef.current.longestStreak,\\n        todayKeyRef.current\\n      );\\n      commitProfile(progRes.profile);\\n      setLastRunXp(progRes.xpAwarded);\\n      if (progRes.leveledUpTo) {\\n        window.setTimeout(() => neonAudio.playLevelUp(), 260);\\n      }\\n\\n      setStatus(\'GAME_OVER\');\\n    },\\n    [bestScore, commitProfile]\\n  );\\n\\n  const returnToTitle = useCallback(() => {\\n    neonAudio.playSelect();\\n    setShowHelp(false);\\n    setToastBanner(\'\');\\n    setStatus(\'TITLE_MENU\');\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Auto-focus primary CTA when modal states transition for seamless D-pad/Keyboard UX\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (showHelp) {\\n      closeHelpBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'TITLE_MENU\') {\\n      startBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'PAUSED\') {\\n      resumeBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    } else if (status === \'GAME_OVER\') {\\n      playAgainBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n    }\\n  }, [status, showHelp]);\\n\\n  // Global keyboard shortcuts for menus & modals\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const onKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      const key = e.key;\\n\\n      if (key === \'m\' || key === \'M\') {\\n        if (status !== \'PLAYING\' || showHelp) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          toggleMute();\\n          return;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      if (showHelp) {\\n        if (key === \'Escape\' || key === \'GoBack\' || key === \'Backspace\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          setShowHelp(false);\\n          if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n            canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n          }\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'DASHBOARD\') {\\n        if (key === \'Escape\' || key === \'GoBack\' || key === \'Backspace\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          closeDashboard();\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'DAILY_SCREEN\') {\\n        if (key === \'Escape\' || key === \'GoBack\' || key === \'Backspace\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          returnToTitle();\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'TITLE_MENU\') {\\n        const activeAction = document.activeElement?.getAttribute(\'data-action\');\\n        if (\\n          (key === \'Enter\' ||\\n            key === \' \' ||\\n            key === \'Select\' ||\\n            key === \'DPadCenter\') &&\\n          activeAction !== \'help\' &&\\n          activeAction !== \'daily\' &&\\n          activeAction !== \'dashboard\'\\n        ) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          startClassicGame();\\n        } else if (key === \'h\' || key === \'H\' || key === \'?\') {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          setShowHelp(true);\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'PAUSED\') {\\n        if (\\n          key === \'Escape\' ||\\n          key === \'p\' ||\\n          key === \'P\' ||\\n          key === \'GoBack\' ||\\n          key === \'MediaPlayPause\'\\n        ) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          pauseGame();\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (status === \'GAME_OVER\') {\\n        const activeAction = document.activeElement?.getAttribute(\'data-action\');\\n        if (\\n          (key === \'Enter\' ||\\n            key === \' \' ||\\n            key === \'Select\' ||\\n            key === \'DPadCenter\') &&\\n          activeAction !== \'menu\' &&\\n          activeAction !== \'daily\' &&\\n          activeAction !== \'dashboard\'\\n        ) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          restartCurrentMode();\\n        }\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n  }, [\\n    status,\\n    showHelp,\\n    startClassicGame,\\n    restartCurrentMode,\\n    returnToTitle,\\n    closeDashboard,\\n    pauseGame,\\n    toggleMute,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  // Allow D-pad navigation across HUD buttons and back to Canvas\\n  const handleHudButtonKeyDown = (\\n    e: React.KeyboardEvent<HTMLButtonElement>,\\n    idx: number\\n  ) => {\\n    const key = e.key;\\n    if (key === \'ArrowDown\' || key === \'ArrowRight\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      if (idx < hudButtonRefs.current.length - 1) {\\n        hudButtonRefs.current[idx + 1]?.focus();\\n      } else if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }\\n    } else if (key === \'ArrowUp\' || key === \'ArrowLeft\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      if (idx > 0) {\\n        hudButtonRefs.current[idx - 1]?.focus();\\n      } else if (status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n        canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n      }\\n    } else if (key === \'Escape\' && status === \'PLAYING\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      canvasHandleRef.current?.focusBoard();\\n    }\\n  };\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1010, \"ReplacementContent\":\"            <button\\n              ref={(el) => {\\n                hudButtonRefs.current[5] = el;\\n              }}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={openHelp}\\n              onKeyDown={(e) => handleHudButtonKeyDown(e, 5)}\\n              className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/25 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-sm font-medium text-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>Help</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400 pt-0.5\\\">\\n            Arrows + Enter \302\267 H Help \302\267 Esc Back\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      {/* Main Playfield Stage */}\\n      <main className=\\\"relative flex-1 min-w-0 min-h-0 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <NeonCanvas\\n          ref={canvasHandleRef}\\n          status={showHelp && status === \'PLAYING\' ? \'PAUSED\' : status}\", \"StartLine\":983, \"TargetContent\":\"            <button\\n              ref={(el) => {\\n                hudButtonRefs.current[5] = el;\\n              }}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setShowHelp(true)}\\n              onKeyDown={(e) => handleHudButtonKeyDown(e, 5)}\\n              className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[44px] px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/25 hover:border-cyan-400/50 text-sm font-medium text-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>Rules</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400 pt-0.5\\\">\\n            Drag or tap to place \302\267 Arrows + Enter/Space \302\267 Esc Pause\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      {/* Main Playfield Stage */}\\n      <main className=\\\"relative flex-1 min-w-0 min-h-0 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <NeonCanvas\\n          ref={canvasHandleRef}\\n          status={status}\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1036, \"ReplacementContent\":\"        {/* TITLE SCREEN OVERLAY */}\\n        {status === \'TITLE_MENU\' && (\", \"StartLine\":1032, \"TargetContent\":\"        {/* TITLE SCREEN OVERLAY */}\\n        {status === \'TITLE_MENU\' && !showHelp && (\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1170, \"ReplacementContent\":\"                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    data-action=\\\"help\\\"\\n                    onClick={openHelp}\\n                    className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[46px] px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F1838] border border-indigo-400/30 hover:border-cyan-400/60 text-slate-200 font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    How to Play\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 pt-0.5\\\">\\n                Drag or Tap \302\267 Arrows + Enter \302\267 H Help \302\267 Esc Back\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* DEDICATED DAILY CHALLENGE SCREEN */}\\n        {status === \'DAILY_SCREEN\' && (\\n          <DailyChallengeScreen\\n            challenge={dailyChallenge}\\n            dailyState={dailyState}\\n            onStartDaily={startDailyGame}\\n            onOpenMilestones={() => openDashboard(\'MILESTONES\')}\\n            onBack={goBackToPreviousView}\\n          />\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* DEDICATED PLAYER DASHBOARD SCREEN */}\\n        {status === \'DASHBOARD\' && (\\n          <DashboardScreen\\n            profile={profile}\\n            dailyState={dailyState}\\n            todayKey={todayKey}\\n            initialTab={dashboardTab}\\n            reducedMotion={reducedMotion}\\n            isHelpOpen={showHelp}\\n            onClaimDailyMilestone={handleClaimDailyMilestone}\\n            onClearComboHistory={handleClearComboHistory}\\n            onSelectTheme={handleSelectTheme}\\n            onSelectParticleStyle={handleSelectParticleStyle}\\n            onOpenDailyChallenge={openDailyScreen}\\n            onBack={goBackToPreviousView}\\n          />\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* PAUSE MODAL */}\\n        {status === \'PAUSED\' && (\", \"StartLine\":1120, \"TargetContent\":\"                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    data-action=\\\"help\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setShowHelp(true)}\\n                    className=\\\"neon-focus min-h-[46px] px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F1838] border border-indigo-400/30 hover:border-cyan-400/60 text-slate-200 font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    Rules\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 pt-0.5\\\">\\n                Drag or Tap to Place \302\267 Arrows + Enter/Space \302\267 Esc Pause\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* DEDICATED DAILY CHALLENGE SCREEN */}\\n        {status === \'DAILY_SCREEN\' && !showHelp && (\\n          <DailyChallengeScreen\\n            challenge={dailyChallenge}\\n            dailyState={dailyState}\\n            onStartDaily={startDailyGame}\\n            onOpenMilestones={() => openDashboard(\'MILESTONES\')}\\n            onBack={returnToTitle}\\n          />\\