  planner_response {
    response: "Added global **`H`** shortcut support for the **How to Play** help modal overlay and unified **`Escape`** back-navigation across every view.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n- **Global `H` Key Trigger for How to Play**\n  - Pressing **`H`** (or **`?`**) from any screen\342\200\224Title Menu, active gameplay, Pause, Game Over, Daily Challenge, or Player Dashboard\342\200\224opens or closes the **How to Play** modal overlay without hijacking browser modifier shortcuts (`Ctrl`/`Cmd`/`Alt`).\n  - The overlay renders above the active view without unmounting underlying screens (preserving your active Dashboard tab and state), softly pauses board interaction if opened mid-game, supports backdrop click-to-close, and restores board focus when closed during gameplay.\n  - Updated in-game keyboard hints and the How to Play controls list to reflect `H / ?` and `Esc / Back`.\n\n- **Unified `Escape` Navigation History Across All Views**\n  - Added a view navigation history stack so **`Escape`** (as well as Fire TV `GoBack`) consistently returns to the exact previous menu state across all screens:\n    - **How to Play overlay** \342\206\222 closes and returns to the underlying view.\n    - **Dashboard reward celebration modal** \342\206\222 dismisses the celebration dialog before stepping back from the Dashboard.\n    - **Dashboard / Daily Challenge** \342\206\222 returns to whichever screen opened it (e.g., `Title Menu \342\206\222 Daily \342\206\222 Dashboard` steps back `Dashboard \342\206\222 Daily \342\206\222 Title Menu`, and `Title Menu \342\206\222 Dashboard \342\206\222 Daily` steps back `Daily \342\206\222 Dashboard \342\206\222 Title Menu`).\n    - **Active Gameplay (`PLAYING`)** \342\206\222 pauses into `PAUSED` regardless of whether the canvas or HUD has focus (duplicate canvas key listeners removed).\n    - **Pause (`PAUSED`)** \342\206\222 resumes `PLAYING` and re-focuses the board.\n    - **Game Over (`GAME_OVER`)** \342\206\222 returns to the originating menu (`Daily Challenge` for Daily runs, or `Title Menu` for Classic runs).\n  - Verified all navigation flows with unit tests, TypeScript linting, and a production build."
    message_id: "3xoEa5vbMsKm1MkP14-U4Qo"
    modified_response: "Added global **`H`** shortcut support for the **How to Play** help modal overlay and unified **`Escape`** back-navigation across every view.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n- **Global `H` Key Trigger for How to Play**\n  - Pressing **`H`** (or **`?`**) from any screen\342\200\224Title Menu, active gameplay, Pause, Game Over, Daily Challenge, or Player Dashboard\342\200\224opens or closes the **How to Play** modal overlay without hijacking browser modifier shortcuts (`Ctrl`/`Cmd`/`Alt`).\n  - The overlay renders above the active view without unmounting underlying screens (preserving your active Dashboard tab and state), softly pauses board interaction if opened mid-game, supports backdrop click-to-close, and restores board focus when closed during gameplay.\n  - Updated in-game keyboard hints and the How to Play controls list to reflect `H / ?` and `Esc / Back`.\n\n- **Unified `Escape` Navigation History Across All Views**\n  - Added a view navigation history stack so **`Escape`** (as well as Fire TV `GoBack`) consistently returns to the exact previous menu state across all screens:\n    - **How to Play overlay** \342\206\222 closes and returns to the underlying view.\n    - **Dashboard reward celebration modal** \342\206\222 dismisses the celebration dialog before stepping back from the Dashboard.\n    - **Dashboard / Daily Challenge** \342\206\222 returns to whichever screen opened it (e.g., `Title Menu \342\206\222 Daily \342\206\222 Dashboard` steps back `Dashboard \342\206\222 Daily \342\206\222 Title Menu`, and `Title Menu \342\206\222 Dashboard \342\206\222 Daily` steps back `Daily \342\206\222 Dashboard \342\206\222 Title Menu`).\n    - **Active Gameplay (`PLAYING`)** \342\206\222 pauses into `PAUSED` regardless of whether the canvas or HUD has focus (duplicate canvas key listeners removed).\n    - **Pause (`PAUSED`)** \342\206\222 resumes `PLAYING` and re-focuses the board.\n    - **Game Over (`GAME_OVER`)** \342\206\222 returns to the originating menu (`Daily Challenge` for Daily runs, or `Title Menu` for Classic runs).\n  - Verified all navigation flows with unit tests, TypeScript linting, and a production build."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\242\002\n\237\002\001i\024}\023/\270\031@\367\361)w1\224P\b\235\242\323\262\324\214&m(\037l\316Q\241\201%hk\362f\005\211?;Tb{!\330.~\22117\001X$\315X\314\022{s\206d\231\316\217AX\030O+\352/C6\347\256\233Vb\3170\352\316\301\252b\t\307\032\004\342\247\262\305\351\366G\334Hk\004\261\377\254\220:\320\262\267nq\201\030\020\353\340\022\251\255SA\020f[\353\366\025\234^x\314\331\311\337`AWZOM\225:\016J\034\210\216\303\323kL\032\206\201OZ\317\271H\022\362\033\t\r\317C_\th!Q\262\372\343(k\262xa\265:}\274T\375=T\315\252\246Au\214A`\016QI}t\356\241/ \275\332\ba\'\232\214\337\313\351\256\301\301\235\224qH\a?~\367w<%\265b.r\v\301\271\224\216\031a\221y\371\021\363_m\222\301\243\35679\324\337f\255\240\340\240@\262\031H\2460\316:\270\321E\360\343)\221\236\216\335\t\215\245\215\3603\317\273\241}"
