    thinking: "**Designing Visualizations**\n\nI\'m quite pleased with the clean structure of `DashboardScreen.tsx`. I\'ve begun to conceptualize a 7-Day Challenge Streak History visualization. It will be a mini-bar chart integrated into the `OVERVIEW` tab, sitting beneath the KPI strip and above the Milestone Preview. The aim is a data-rich and visually engaging design, perhaps with glowing SVG sparklines.\n\n\n**Analyzing Data Requirements**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down into the data needed for the 7-day streak visualization. I\'ve got a good handle on the data structure: I can access completion, progress, attempts, scores, and target values for each of the last seven days, via date keys. I\'ve worked out how to calculate a `progressPct` metric. It will be the central data point I\'ll visualize.\n\n\n**Refining Chart Elements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on specific visual elements for the 7-day consistency chart. I\'m aiming for a premium neon arcade aesthetic, and working without external chart libraries. I\'m focusing on the header row, including the title with an icon, and the right summary metrics. I\'m also planning the combined mini-bar chart and trend sparkline, with interactive tooltips for each day\'s column. I\'m also going to add a link to play today.\n\n\n**Defining Visual Specifications**\n\nI\'ve specified the visual components for the 7-day streak chart in detail. I\'m focusing on accessibility and visual appeal. I\'m utilizing an `aria-label` for screen readers, and a vertical neon bar track in a dark background. Completed days have a full gradient bar with a checkmark. In-progress days show partial progress with indigo/blue bars. Missed days are represented by a muted slate stub. Finally, an SVG sparkline will connect the progress vertices with a subtle gradient fill.\n\n\n**Detailing Color Palette**\n\nI\'m now detailing the visual specifications. I\'ve chosen a color scheme: crisp, bright cyan `#22D3EE` for completed days, soft blue `#818CF8` for partial progress, and slate `#334155` for unplayed days. The day axis will be clear with weekday labels and a status symbol, plus a concise legend explaining each status. I\'m also planning to build a pure helper to improve testing.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "YRsEa521NYXRz7IP7qaI0Qk"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_18360880837949063514"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add pure 7-day Daily Challenge streak history builder using local calendar dates\", \"EndLine\":398, \"Instruction\":\"Add SevenDayStreakPoint interface and buildSevenDayStreakHistory helper to src/game/daily.ts for consistent 7-day streak visualization.\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"export function saveParticleIntensity(intensity: ParticleIntensity): void {\\n  try {\\n    window.localStorage.setItem(PARTICLE_INTENSITY_KEY, intensity);\\n  } catch {\\n    // Ignore storage errors\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SevenDayStreakPoint {\\n  dateKey: string;\\n  dayShort: string;\\n  dayNum: number;\\n  readableDate: string;\\n  isToday: boolean;\\n  completed: boolean;\\n  attempted: boolean;\\n  progressPct: number; // 0..100\\n  bestScore: number;\\n  challengeTitle: string;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Builds an ordered 7-day history ending on todayKey (oldest -> today)\\n * showing Daily Challenge completion and progress consistency.\\n */\\nexport function buildSevenDayStreakHistory(\\n  state: DailySaveState,\\n  todayKey: string = getLocalDateKey()\\n): {\\n  days: SevenDayStreakPoint[];\\n  completedCount: number;\\n  consistencyPct: number;\\n} {\\n  const days: SevenDayStreakPoint[] = Array.from({ length: 7 }, (_, i) => {\\n    const key = offsetLocalDateKey(todayKey, i - 6);\\n    const [y, m, d] = key.split(\'-\').map((n) => parseInt(n, 10));\\n    const dt = new Date(y, m - 1, d);\\n    const dayShort = dt.toLocaleDateString(undefined, { weekday: \'short\' });\\n    const challenge = generateDailyChallenge(key);\\n    const rec = state.records[key];\\n    const completed = Boolean(rec?.completed);\\n    const attempted = Boolean(rec && (rec.attempts > 0 || rec.bestProgress > 0));\\n    const progressPct = completed\\n      ? 100\\n      : rec && rec.bestProgress > 0\\n        ? Math.min(\\n            95,\\n            Math.max(\\n              10,\\n              Math.round((rec.bestProgress / Math.max(1, challenge.targetValue)) * 100)\\n            )\\n          )\\n        : attempted\\n          ? 12\\n          : 0;\\n\\n    return {\\n      dateKey: key,\\n      dayShort,\\n      dayNum: dt.getDate(),\\n      readableDate: formatReadableDate(key),\\n      isToday: key === todayKey,\\n      completed,\\n      attempted,\\n      progressPct,\\n      bestScore: rec?.bestScore ?? 0,\\n      challengeTitle: challenge.title,\\n    };\\n  });\\n\\n  const completedCount = days.filter((d) => d.completed).length;\\n  const consistencyPct = Math.round((completedCount / 7) * 100);\\n\\n  return { days, completedCount, consistencyPct };\\n}\\n\", \"StartLine\":390, \"TargetContent\":\"export function saveParticleIntensity(intensity: ParticleIntensity): void {\\n  try {\\n    window.localStorage.setItem(PARTICLE_INTENSITY_KEY, intensity);\\n  } catch {\\n    // Ignore storage errors\\n  }\\n}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/game/daily.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding 7-day streak history helper in daily.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add 7-day streak helper\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\217-\n\214-\001i\024}\023\001\034\372\203C\240\02613\345\016\004B\021\332A\253\376cQ\322\305S\360\260q\000\270\006\356C\315&\034\340]\025E5\001\a\375\344Ab\037@X\213W\355\215Tz\315\022\265l-\330f\336\262\335)aA\031\274#r\246\237s\f\327\260>!\201S\274W\270\377H\250\'\2339\220\025V\220i\v\372wOk\271/_0\224\322\271\367<\244s\247;\355m\374\224\024\252\247\000\016\2070\204\0042\253\377\"\365\242\320\332m\244\362\036\360\203.\201\033\016\220\237\300P\357.\373\251\212\341s5\352\023,\272/\357\205\006\224\324\200I\337LjB\204\226\3473Fd\'\a\217=\372\022+\331\375\241\002\332\244\221\312\323zP\326\250\316k\177\303\025z2\336\361q\270\272$\341\374\252@\247\250w+K\347\300+\307\271~vY\360\353\350BJ\177\326\a]\354\2167@\222r\r\032\353J_\227#\037f\345\276\332^n\363\271\r\313\224\332\272\250S\224\212\371\345\343\302\031\v\004{VvLV\0057\220\a]Fc\241\275\017\236\310\210\227\0269\263(\034\n\332>\017\353\'g\240\033\02600\252\206#2y5P\311\306b\234\277\0010\370\225\241\245\225\256\254\251:\3269\230!\234\037\2449v\254\032o\211J\277\017\032{\367\a\332r`\356\221Q\215\024n\275\023P\242\226\233\033\265&\263\303\346O\335\002\321\305\260S#4NE\216C\3163C\226\364\343\240\353\023%{@\247<\000\262b5\177Uq\232,Ka\222\362.\30357\270\002y\026\236\340\a\333\272C\324\347\272\276\243\343\332Z\247$\344j\377\3370C\210\223Q\343>\030\234\265\257O\260\002\330\233\2615J\3239\326\275l\361\240&0\b\324\301-%y\321\034\037T\210}\313\2218\201\364:\367d\2341\231P\317\336*\203\243aZ\323DG\201\255q\212\254\036a@\005\207_\320\253\313\242\b\362\275\3113\324\251\232\227\352\376\002\322\212\354\261\'\200\330\303\355\217\235\n\023`4\213\350\3742q]\034#\037c\232\373\3548\220\204\216kS\312aC\025q\334\324\f\021\337\361\026\321c\231u0\321\b\aZF\001\376\266\000\320\3314\330l\344\332\"\245r\023\037*\303\250\332\311R\345[\304\235\336\236\346\234\257\345\346\247\255\032\231\210\315V\211\022\314\223G6\263\205$\b\255R\233{\304\200\030<\250\377\325\202\260\2552\232\335\325\224\314\377r\346\242\242\244\206\3