  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Streak History**\n\nI\'m currently focused on integrating the 7-Day Streak History chart and sparkline into the Overview tab of `/src/components/DashboardScreen.tsx`. To optimize performance, I\'m using `useMemo` on `buildSevenDayStreakHistory(dailyState, todayKey)` to avoid unnecessary recomputations. This should keep things efficient and responsive.\n\n\n**Refining Visualization Details**\n\nI\'ve been refining the 7-day streak visualization. Initially, I implemented a combined mini-bar chart and SVG sparkline overlay. However, I\'ve realized that using `preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"` with `<circle>` elements can lead to horizontal stretching on wider screens. To address this, I\'m now rendering the polyline and gradient area fill within the SVG, alongside `vectorEffect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"`. The circular vertex dots are being rendered using CSS within each grid column to ensure perfect circularity at all screen widths.\n\n\n**Aligning Visual Coordinates**\n\nI\'m now deeply involved in aligning the SVG polyline vertices and the CSS vertex dots, ensuring they are perfectly identical. I\'ve meticulously verified the mathematical calculations within the `relative h-24` chart plot area. Specifically, the y-coordinate calculations within the SVG `viewBox` and the CSS positioning within each column. This includes confirming the precise `x` and `y` values for the polyline vertices and the vertical positioning of the dots relative to the 12% bottom padding, factoring in the `progressPct`. I\'m confident in achieving precise visual alignment.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "ghsEa_jhGJeUmtkP7ZvIgA8"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6197160376386407317"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add interactive 7-day challenge streak mini-bar chart and sparkline to DashboardScreen Overview tab\", \"Instruction\":\"Import buildSevenDayStreakHistory and useMemo, compute 7-day streak history and SVG sparkline coordinates, and render the 7-Day Challenge Consistency chart section in DashboardScreen.tsx.\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":22, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useMemo, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  ArrowLeft,\\n  Award,\\n  Check,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  Flame,\\n  Gift,\\n  History,\\n  Lock,\\n  Palette,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  Trash2,\\n  Trophy,\\n  Zap,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport {\\n  buildSevenDayStreakHistory,\\n  formatReadableDate,\\n  getEffectiveStreak,\\n} from \'../game/daily\';\", \"StartLine\":1, \"TargetContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  ArrowLeft,\\n  Award,\\n  Check,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  Flame,\\n  Gift,\\n  History,\\n  Lock,\\n  Palette,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  Trash2,\\n  Trophy,\\n  Zap,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { formatReadableDate, getEffectiveStreak } from \'../game/daily\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":106, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState<DashboardTab>(initialTab);\\n  const [confirmClear, setConfirmClear] = useState(false);\\n  const [selectedStreakDayIdx, setSelectedStreakDayIdx] = useState<number>(6);\\n  const [claimCelebration, setClaimCelebration] =\\n    useState<ClaimMilestoneResult | null>(null);\\n  const backBtnRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    setActiveTab(initialTab);\\n  }, [initialTab]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    setSelectedStreakDayIdx(6);\\n  }, [todayKey]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    backBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Dismiss reward celebration dialog on Escape before returning from Dashboard\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!claimCelebration || isHelpOpen) return;\\n    const onKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      if (e.key === \'Escape\' || e.key === \'GoBack\' || e.key === \'Backspace\') {\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        e.stopImmediatePropagation();\\n        setClaimCelebration(null);\\n      }\\n    };\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown, true);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown, true);\\n  }, [claimCelebration, isHelpOpen]);\\n\\n  const levelInfo = computeLevelFromTotalXp(profile.xp);\\n  const rankTitle = getPlayerRankTitle(levelInfo.level);\\n  const milestoneStatus = getDailyMilestoneStatus(profile, todayKey);\\n  const dailyChallengeStreak = getEffectiveStreak(dailyState, todayKey);\\n  const displayStreak = Math.max(\\n    milestoneStatus.effectiveStreak,\\n    dailyChallengeStreak\\n  );\\n  const milestoneProgressPct = Math.min(\\n    100,\\n    Math.round((milestoneStatus.effectiveCycleDay / 30) * 100)\\n  );\\n\\n  const sevenDayHistory = useMemo(\\n    () => buildSevenDayStreakHistory(dailyState, todayKey),\\n    [dailyState, todayKey]\\n  );\\n\\n  const sparklineGeometry = useMemo(() => {\\n    const pts = sevenDayHistory.days.map((day, idx) => {\\n      const x = (idx + 0.5) * 100;\\n      const y = 88 - day.progressPct * 0.76;\\n      return { x, y };\\n    });\\n    const linePoints = pts.map((p) => `${p.x},${p.y}`).join(\' \');\\n    const areaPoints = `50,88 ${linePoints} 650,88`;\\n    return { linePoints, areaPoints };\\n  }, [sevenDayHistory]);\\n\\n  const inspectedStreakDay =\\n    sevenDayHistory.days[selectedStreakDayIdx] ?? sevenDayHistory.days[6];\\n  const todayCompleted = Boolean(sevenDayHistory.days[6]?.completed);\", \"StartLine\":63, \"TargetContent\":\"  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState<DashboardTab>(initialTab);\\n  const [confirmClear, setConfirmClear] = useState(false);\\n  const [claimCelebration, setClaimCelebration] =\\n    useState<ClaimMilestoneResult | null>(null);\\n  const backBtnRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    setActiveTab(initialTab);\\n  }, [initialTab]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    backBtnRef.current?.focus();\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Dismiss reward celebration dialog on Escape before returning from Dashboard\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!claimCelebration || isHelpOpen) return;\\n    const onKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      if (e.key === \'Escape\' || e.key === \'GoBack\' || e.key === \'Backspace\') {\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        e.stopImmediatePropagation();\\n        setClaimCelebration(null);\\n      }\\n    };\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown, true);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown, true);\\n  }, [claimCelebration, isHelpOpen]);\\n\\n  const levelInfo = computeLevelFromTotalXp(profile.xp);\\n  const rankTitle = getPlayerRankTitle(levelInfo.level);\\n  const milestoneStatus = getDailyMilestoneStatus(profile, todayKey);\\n  const dailyChallengeStreak = getEffectiveStreak(dailyState, todayKey);\\n  const displayStreak = Math.max(\\n    milestoneStatus.effectiveStreak,\\n    dailyChallengeStreak\\n  );\\n  const milestoneProgressPct = Math.min(\\n    100,\\n    Math.round((milestoneStatus.effectiveCycleDay / 30) * 100)\\n  );\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":372, \"ReplacementContent\":\"                <div className=\\\"rounded-xl bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/20 p-4 space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    <Gift className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                    <span>Milestone Day</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-2xl font-extrabold text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                    {milestoneStatus.effectiveCycleDay}{\' \'}\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400\\\">\\n                      / 30\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    {profile.milestones.pendingBonusPoints > 0\\n                      ? `+${profile.milestones.pendingBonusPoints} bonus ready`\\n                      : milestoneStatus.canClaimToday\\n                        ? \'Reward available\'\\n                        : \'Claimed today\'}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </section>\\n\\n              {/* 7-Day Daily Challenge Streak History (Mini-Bar Chart + Sparkline) */}\\n              <section\\n                aria-label=\\\"7-day challenge streak history\\\"\\n                className=\\\"rounded-xl bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/25 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-4\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"space-y-0.5\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                      <Flame className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                      <h3 className=\\\"font-display text-base font-bold text-white\\\">\\n                        7-Day Streak History\\n                      </h3>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                      Daily Challenge completion consistency over the past 7 days\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-slate-300\\\">\\n                      <strong className=\\\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\\\">\\n                        {sevenDayHistory.completedCount}/7\\n                      </strong>{\' \'}\\n                      Completed\\n                      <span className=\\\"mx-1.5 text-slate-600\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                        \302\267\\n                      </span>\\n                      <strong className=\\\"text-purple-300 font-bold\\\">\\n                        {sevenDayHistory.consistencyPct}%\\n                      </strong>\\n                    </div>\\n                    {!todayCompleted && (\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={onOpenDailyChallenge}\\n                        className=\\\"neon-focus text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-cyan-400/35 hover:border-cyan-300/70 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Play Today\\n                      </button>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Plot Container: Mini-Bars + Overlaid Trend Sparkline */}\\n                <div className=\\\"rounded-xl bg-[#070C1E] border border-slate-800/90 pt-3 pb-2.5 px-2 sm:px-3 space-y-2\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative h-24 sm:h-28 w-full\\\">\\n                    {/* Horizontal Reference Guide Lines */}\\n                    <div\\n                      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-1 top-[12%] border-t border-dashed border-cyan-500/15\\\"\\n                    />\\n                    <div\\n                      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-1 top-[50%] border-t border-dashed border-slate-700/40\\\"\\n                    />\\n                    <div\\n                      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-1 bottom-[12%] border-t border-slate-800\\\"\\n                    />\\n\\n                    {/* Overlaid SVG Sparkline + Area Fill */}\\n                    <svg\\n                      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                      viewBox=\\\"0 0 700 100\\\"\\n                      preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 w-full h-full\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <defs>\\n                        <linearGradient\\n                          id=\\\"neonStreakAreaGrad\\\"\\n                          x1=\\\"0\\\"\\n                          y1=\\\"0\\\"\\n                          x2=\\\"0\\\"\\n                          y2=\\\"1\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <stop\\n                            offset=\\\"0%\\\"\\n                            stopColor=\\\"#22D3EE\\\"\\n                            stopOpacity=\\\"0.22\\\"\\n                          />\\n                          <stop\\n                            offset=\\\"100%\\\"\\n                            stopColor=\\\"#6366F1\\\"\\n                            stopOpacity=\\\"0.01\\\"\\n                          />\\n                        </linearGradient>\\n                        <linearGradient\\n                          id=\\\"neonStreakLineGrad\\\"\\n                          x1=\\\"0\\\"\\n                          y1=\\\"0\\\"\\n                          x2=\\\"1\\\"\\n                          y2=\\\"0\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#60A5FA\\\" />\\n                          <stop offset=\\\"55%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#22D3EE\\\" />\\n                          <stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#A855F7\\\" />\\n                        </linearGradient>\\n                      </defs>\\n                      <polygon\\n                        points={sparklineGeometry.areaPoints}\\n                        fill=\\\"url(#neonStreakAreaGrad)\\\"\\n                      />\\n                      <polyline\\n                        points={sparklineGeometry.linePoints}\\n                        fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                        stroke=\\\"url(#neonStreakLineGrad)\\\"\\n                        strokeWidth=\\\"2.25\\\"\\n                        strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n                        strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n                        vectorEffect=\\\"non-scaling-stroke\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </svg>\\n\\n                    {/* 7 Mini-Bar Columns + Perfectly Round Vertex Dots */}\\n                    <div className=\\\"relative z-10 grid grid-cols-7 h-full w-full\\\">\\n                      {sevenDayHistory.days.map((day, idx) => {\\n                        const isSelected = idx === selectedStreakDayIdx;\\n                        const barHeightPct = day.completed\\n                          ? 76\\n                          : day.progressPct > 0\\n                            ? Math.max(10, day.progressPct * 0.76)\\n                            : 0;\\n                        const dotBottomPct = 12 + day.progressPct * 0.76;\\n\\n                        return (\\n                          <button\\n                            key={day.dateKey}\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() => setSelectedStreakDayIdx(idx)}\\n                            onMouseEnter={() => setSelectedStreakDayIdx(idx)}\\n                            onFocus={() => setSelectedStreakDayIdx(idx)}\\n                            aria-label={`${day.readableDate}: ${\\n                              day.completed\\n                                ? \'Challenge completed\'\\n                                : day.attempted\\n                                  ? `Attempted, ${day.progressPct}% progress`\\n                                  : \'Not completed\'\\n                            }`}\\n                            aria-pressed={isSelected}\\n                            className={`neon-focus group relative h-full w-full rounded-lg transition-colors ${\\n                              isSelected ? \'bg-cyan-400/[0.06]\' : \'hover:bg-white/[0.03]\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            {/* Mini-Bar Track */}\\n                            <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 sm:inset-x-3.5 bottom-[12%] top-[12%] flex items-end justify-center\\\">\\n                              {barHeightPct > 0 ? (\\n                                <div\\n                                  className={`w-full max-w-[26px] rounded-t-md ${\\n                                    reducedMotion ? \'\' : \'transition-all duration-200\'\\n                                  } ${\\n                                    day.completed\\n                                      ? \'bg-gradient-to-t from-blue-600/80 via-cyan-400/85 to-purple-400/90 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(34,211,238,0.38)] border-t border-cyan-200/80\'\\n                                      : \'bg-gradient-to-t from-indigo-900/80 to-indigo-400/75 border-t border-indigo-300/60\'\\n                                  }`}\\n                                  style={{ height: `${(barHeightPct / 76) * 100}%` }}\\n                                />\\n                              ) : (\\n                                <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-[26px] h-[4px] rounded-full bg-slate-800/90\\\" />\\n                              )}\\n                            </div>\\n\\n                            {/* Sparkline Vertex Marker */}\\n                            <span\\n                              aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                              className={`pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border ${\\n                                reducedMotion ? \'\' : \'transition-transform duration-150\'\\n                              } ${\\n                                isSelected ? \'scale-125\' : \'\'\\n                              } ${\\n                                day.completed\\n                                  ? \'w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-cyan-300 border-white shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(34,211,238,0.9)]\'\\n                                  : day.attempted\\n                                    ? \'w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-400 border-indigo-200\'\\n                                    : \'w-2 h-2 bg-slate-700 border-slate-500\'\\n                              }`}\\n                              style={{ bottom: `${dotBottomPct}%` }}\\n                            />\\n                          </button>\\n                        );\\n                      })}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* 7-Day Axis Labels */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-7 text-center\\\">\\n                    {sevenDayHistory.days.map((day, idx) => {\\n                      const isSelected = idx === selectedStreakDayIdx;\\n                      return (\\n                        <button\\n                          key={day.dateKey}\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => setSelectedStreakDayIdx(idx)}\\n                          className={`neon-focus py-1 rounded-md flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 transition-colors ${\\n                            isSelected ? \'bg-[#101A3B]\' : \'hover:bg-white/[0.03]\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        >\\n                          <span\\n                            className={`text-[11px] leading-none ${\\n                              day.isToday\\n                                ? \'text-cyan-300 font-bold\'\\n                                : isSelected\\n                                  ? \'text-slate-100 font-semibold\'\\n                                  : \'text-slate-400\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            {day.isToday ? \'Today\' : day.dayShort}\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-none\\\">\\n                            {day.dayNum}\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span\\n                            aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                            className={`text-[10px] leading-none font-bold ${\\n                              day.completed\\n                                ? \'text-cyan-300\'\\n                                : day.attempted\\n                                  ? \'text-indigo-400\'\\n                                  : \'text-slate-700\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            {day.completed ? \'\342\234\223\' : day.attempted ? \'\342\200\242\' : \'\342\200\224\'}\\n                          </span>\\n                        </button>\\n                      );\\n                    })}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Selected Day Detail + Compact Legend */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-slate-300 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-0.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-white\\\">\\n                      {inspectedStreakDay.readableDate}\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-slate-600\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                      \302\267\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">\\n                      {inspectedStreakDay.challengeTitle}\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-slate-600\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                      \302\267\\n                    </span>\\n                    {inspectedStreakDay.completed ? (\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-cyan-300 font-semibold font-mono-nums\\\">\\n                        Completed\\n                        {inspectedStreakDay.bestScore > 0\\n                          ? ` (${inspectedStreakDay.bestScore.toLocaleString()} pts)`\\n                          : \'\'}\\n                      </span>\\n                    ) : inspectedStreakDay.attempted ? (\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-indigo-300 font-mono-nums\\\">\\n                        {inspectedStreakDay.progressPct}% goal reached\\n                      </span>\\n                    ) : (\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">Missed</span>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-cyan-400 inline-block\\\" />\\n                      Done\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-indigo-400 inline-block\\\" />\\n                      Attempted\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-sm bg-slate-700 inline-block\\\" />\\n                      Missed\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </section>\", \"StartLine\":345, \"TargetContent\":\"                <div className=\\\"rounded-xl bg-[#0D1530] border border-indigo-500/20 p-4 space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                    <Gift className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-300 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                    <span>Milestone Day</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"font-mono-nums text-2xl font-extrabold text-cyan-300\\\">\\n                    {mileston