  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Testing the Assertion Logic**\n\nI\'m now putting the `buildSevenDayStreakHistory` function through its paces. Automated assertions are being used to rigorously check its behavior under various scenarios: empty state, partial progress, a full seven-day streak, a mix of completed days, and even a month boundary rollover (like October 26th to November 1st). The next step is a simultaneous run of `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` with the tested and validated function.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "xxsEa5erBpSsqtsP2dP3mA0"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_13132006898474583720"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"npx tsx -e \\\"\\nimport assert from \'node:assert/strict\';\\nimport { buildSevenDayStreakHistory, generateDailyChallenge } from \'./src/game/daily.ts\';\\n\\n// 1. Empty state across month boundary (2026-11-02 -> 2026-10-27..2026-11-02)\\nconst emptyState = { currentStreak: 0, longestStreak: 0, lastCompletedDate: null, totalShards: 0, records: {} };\\nconst emptyHist = buildSevenDayStreakHistory(emptyState, \'2026-11-02\');\\nassert.equal(emptyHist.days.length, 7);\\nassert.equal(emptyHist.days[0].dateKey, \'2026-10-27\');\\nassert.equal(emptyHist.days[6].dateKey, \'2026-11-02\');\\nassert.equal(emptyHist.days[6].isToday, true);\\nassert.equal(emptyHist.completedCount, 0);\\nassert.equal(emptyHist.consistencyPct, 0);\\nassert.ok(emptyHist.days.every((d) => d.progressPct === 0 && !d.completed && !d.attempted));\\n\\n// 2. Mixed completion, partial progress, and missed days\\nconst chNov20 = generateDailyChallenge(\'2026-11-20\');\\nconst mixedState = {\\n  currentStreak: 2,\\n  longestStreak: 3,\\n  lastCompletedDate: \'2026-11-23\',\\n  totalShards: 600,\\n  records: {\\n    \'2026-11-18\': { dateKey: \'2026-11-18\', completed: true, rewardClaimed: true, bestProgress: 9999, bestScore: 2400, attempts: 1 },\\n    \'2026-11-20\': { dateKey: \'2026-11-20\', completed: false, rewardClaimed: false, bestProgress: Math.floor(chNov20.targetValue * 0.5), bestScore: 800, attempts: 2 },\\n    \'2026-11-22\': { dateKey: \'2026-11-22\', completed: true, rewardClaimed: true, bestProgress: 9999, bestScore: 3100, attempts: 1 },\\n    \'2026-11-23\': { dateKey: \'2026-11-23\', completed: true, rewardClaimed: true, bestProgress: 9999, bestScore: 1950, attempts: 1 },\\n  },\\n};\\nconst mixedHist = buildSevenDayStreakHistory(mixedState, \'2026-11-23\');\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.completedCount, 3);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.consistencyPct, 43);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[0].dateKey, \'2026-11-17\');\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[0].completed, false);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[1].completed, true);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[1].progressPct, 100);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[3].dateKey, \'2026-11-20\');\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[3].completed, false);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[3].attempted, true);\\nassert.ok(mixedHist.days[3].progressPct >= 45 && mixedHist.days[3].progressPct <= 55);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[5].completed, true);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[6].completed, true);\\nassert.equal(mixedHist.days[6].isToday, true);\\n\\nconsole.log(\'ALL 7-DAY STREAK HISTORY TESTS PASSED\');\\n\\\"\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Testing 7-day streak history calculation\", \"toolSummary\":\"Test 7-day streak history\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\306\003\n\303\003\001i\024}\023\205\255\006\367\374x\224\024n\370\306>\a\223\004I\243~\356q\255\322\276\353\2079\t\351\362\361\201\026/8Q\313\372\272\235\022&i\300z\030vl\235~\236\314\256?\004\277 \300\300\367(ar\002\302\316\252B\233#XF:\265\031\352\314\302\264\223\241\317{\377\312\305:0ii\333W{Yj\030\"\313j\317\310\307\t[^\037\234\316\032\230q\353\252\217lEu\266\211\251p\341\005\177\f\230\200E\372\203\306\247\206y\210\364_\271z\306\t>\337\321U\222\352\352\227\036P\202\177\\2\325\304+\246\304\205K\240\340Z\177\334\366\376\305\316\343\'\t\nS\367`m\242\275\327\355\026\031hv\004r\207\335\217jd\226B\003\247\316U\272:\215\267\370\351\215 n\257\245\264\334C\337&cw\237\211\276I=/\000r[6v\240\2564E\031\216\300 k\363o[\031\274M\ayB\363\265/\311\t]]\\T8\vF\210\031\026\023\220\375\356\016R\310\324\242\212\036N\032\240\243\347\250\000\237\257\tb\201\354\303Q\343\376\241\307\357\331\377\224\244\257o\257n*&Y\205nC{\302E\036\026F\315\362A!n\211\a;\276\376\004R\312\350v\314\006\a\302\216\206Q\tt\271\366\034\0262h\300\vsQ\315f6\326F\350\312\353I\356\226:\226\253\203y\243\t\n\355\207\230~\001X\037\312\330\301v\271\244\310\v\337#\256\033\331\243j\337\367\fq\377M\214\252\2473\273\374\223\023\032\263D\027\346\272v~\247n\373\247\332\312J\317\213%Q\355M+Ka\327\350@\320\306\223\342\231\363\000\357\315\n\vh\347\272\226X\367w"
