  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying a Calculation**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed why line 57 failed in that `mixedHist.days[3].progressPct` calculation. It looks like an integer rounding discrepancy within the calculation of `chNov20.targetValue` is to blame! Specifically, the division of an odd `chNov20.targetValue` (e.g. 9) by two, resulting in a floor function, gives a value of 4, or 44%, which when rounded is less than 45%. I will now verify this hypothesis!\n\n\n"
