  planner_response {
    response: "Updated the **Player Dashboard** (`Overview` tab) with a **7-Day Streak History** mini-bar chart and trend sparkline visualizing Daily Challenge consistency over the past 7 local calendar days.\n\n### What Was Added\n\n- **7-Day Mini-Bar Chart & Sparkline Overlay**\n  - Plots each of the last 7 local calendar days (oldest through **Today**) using real offline Daily Challenge records and deterministic daily targets.\n  - Displays full neon cyan-to-purple bars with glowing vertex nodes for **Completed** days, proportional indigo progress bars for **Attempted** days, and baseline markers for **Missed** days, connected by a gradient SVG consistency sparkline with soft area fill.\n  - Shows a 7-day completion counter (`X/7 Completed`), consistency percentage, and a quick **Play Today** button when today\'s challenge is not yet finished.\n\n- **Interactive Day Inspection & Accessibility**\n  - Hovering, focusing, or tapping any day column or axis label highlights that day and updates the detail strip below the chart with the date, challenge title, completion status, goal progress percentage, and best score.\n  - Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`, uses `tabular-nums` alignment, requires zero external dependencies, and scales cleanly across Android tablets and narrow viewports.\n  - Verified with unit tests across month boundaries, mixed completion/partial-attempt records, TypeScript linting, and a production build."
    message_id: "HBwEa53iAabVz7IPh5Si2Qk"
    modified_response: "Updated the **Player Dashboard** (`Overview` tab) with a **7-Day Streak History** mini-bar chart and trend sparkline visualizing Daily Challenge consistency over the past 7 local calendar days.\n\n### What Was Added\n\n- **7-Day Mini-Bar Chart & Sparkline Overlay**\n  - Plots each of the last 7 local calendar days (oldest through **Today**) using real offline Daily Challenge records and deterministic daily targets.\n  - Displays full neon cyan-to-purple bars with glowing vertex nodes for **Completed** days, proportional indigo progress bars for **Attempted** days, and baseline markers for **Missed** days, connected by a gradient SVG consistency sparkline with soft area fill.\n  - Shows a 7-day completion counter (`X/7 Completed`), consistency percentage, and a quick **Play Today** button when today\'s challenge is not yet finished.\n\n- **Interactive Day Inspection & Accessibility**\n  - Hovering, focusing, or tapping any day column or axis label highlights that day and updates the detail strip below the chart with the date, challenge title, completion status, goal progress percentage, and best score.\n  - Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`, uses `tabular-nums` alignment, requires zero external dependencies, and scales cleanly across Android tablets and narrow viewports.\n  - Verified with unit tests across month boundaries, mixed completion/partial-attempt records, TypeScript linting, and a production build."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\231\002\n\226\002\001i\024}\023\227\223=\217J\260\277\033\301*\375\333\311o2\241;\245sY\214F(\027\264\034\300\246\257w =@\232N\231\n\033\230\230BP\236\016}\363\264\225o\205\335Q\232U\3713\226a\331\252\251)\274p\f\375\346C\257\214yC\341z\357%]\037\333(\202\326\234E\332\213\242\004WA\307V\"\220\265\260yZ\001u\210\231*\3472\366z\005\217\201\216\"2-\231\342\251\035\241\311\006\202g\224V:\223\3044*c\250e\305@9$J$\216`\233\006M\301\236\325\236F\273\216\363M9\321\363R|\225\'\373\017O\310\331\335;\361{HKu\a)]\304\364;\300\225^\242[\247P\006\262\307\352k\210\266T\240\316\344\232\b\357\345\225\331Hx\302Kp\361z\243\216\245;\317\325\234\336\271\373F\222B\222\244\270\ae\302\316\275\016\345[\310H\t\004\376u/\271c\235\260\211*\023\327\323\232\315\3746\274T\310\326~\223\344u\257{\375\330\317\216;\306\331NY\252"
