  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating Streak Visualization**\n\nI\'m currently integrating the Streak Visualization dashboard tab into `/src/components/DashboardScreen.tsx`. This includes unifying the `streakState` prop to ensure both the Overview and dedicated Streaks tabs show synchronized metrics, specifically `currentStreak` and `bestStreak`. I\'m aiming for a cohesive and intuitive user experience.\n\n\n**Refining Streak Milestones**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Streak Hero Banner and Streak Milestone Indicators within the dedicated Streaks tab. The banner will feature an animated neon flame, current and best streaks, flame tier labels, and qualification status. The indicators will highlight 3, 7, 14, and 30-day milestones with progress bars and clear status labels. I am striving to make these zero-conflict with existing logic.\n\n\n**Visualizing Daily Activity**\n\nI\'m now focusing on enhanced visualizations for daily activity. I am implementing a seven-day mini-bar chart with an SVG sparkline and a selectable day inspector. I\'m also working on a 30-day rolling calendar grid that clearly distinguishes completed, missed, pending, and upcoming days, with month/year rollover tags and interactive day inspection. I\'m prioritizing making the visualizations intuitive and insightful.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "xh8Ea_TMDLm8jrEPvcDrsAw"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9979169043391719317"
