    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":109,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T10:26:08Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":20104,\"cache_read_tokens\":5371,\"output_tokens\":208,\"thinking\":\"**Reviewing Current State**\\n\\nI\'ve just written all the code edits to disk for the NEON BLOCK upgrade. This includes Daily Reward Milestones, Combo History, Player Progression, the Dashboard, and versioned storage with validation and migration. Now I\'m ready to move on.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling application bundle\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking TypeScript and lint rules\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Lint applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":112,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T10:26:29Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":20490,\"cache_read_tokens\":5371,\"output_tokens\":682,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Initial Success**\\n\\nI\'m pleased to report that both `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` executed without issues on their initial attempts! I\'m now moving forward with a comprehensive automated verification script, leveraging `run_command` and `npx tsx` to ensure robust testing. I\'m starting by focusing on the Daily Reward Milestones, specifically examining a 30-day progression across consecutive local dates, which starts on `20...`.\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing Feature Implementations**\\n\\nI\'m now diving deep into the recently implemented features, starting with Daily Reward Milestones and Combo History. For the daily rewards, I\'m verifying the 30-day progression, duplicate claim prevention, and clock rollback protection, along with streak reset and cycle rollover. Regarding Combo History, I\'m checking the event recording, cap verification, and history clearing. Finally, I will test Player Progression, including XP awards, level-up unlocks, and achievement mechanics.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/game/progression.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading progression module exports\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read progression module\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":114,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T10:26:47Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":42226,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":4817,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Migration Flaw**\\n\\nI\'ve zeroed in on line 364 of `src/game/progression.ts`. During the code review, I identified a critical flaw in the `validateAndMigrateProfile` function when handling v1 storage migration. Specifically, if `raw` is `null` and `legacyDaily` is present, the level unlock condition wasn\'t met when `base.level` hits 3+.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"npx tsx -e \\\\\\\"\\\\nimport assert from \'node:assert/strict\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  createDefaultProfile,\\\\n  validateAndMigrateProfile,\\\\n  getDailyMilestoneStatus,\\\\n  claimDailyMilestoneReward,\\\\n  consumePendingBonusPoints,\\\\n  recordTurnProgression,\\\\n  recordGameComplet\\n<truncated 13483 bytes>\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running automated progression and gameplay tests\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run automated tests\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":116,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-23T10:27:49Z\",\"model\":\"gemini-4-neon\",\"input_tokens\":47320,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":118,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/game/types.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking type definitions for test script\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read type definitions