  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering Project Assets**\n\nI\'ve just found some interesting files in `/src/game` and `/src/components`. Seems like there\'s already code for streaks, audio management, and even an audio settings panel. There\'s also a neon flame component, which is cool. This gives me a good starting point for understanding the existing game structure. This will definitely help me with my work.\n\n\n"
