  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Game Types**\n\nI\'ve made significant progress updating game types. Specifically, I\'ve integrated `AudioSettingsState`, `StreakSaveState`, `StreakCalendarDay`, `StreakMilestoneTier`, and `DashboardTab` with its \'STREAKS\' option into `src/game/types.ts`. The structure is shaping up nicely.\n\n\n**Integrating New Features**\n\nI\'ve completed integrating the core streak logic, handling local dates and transitions. I\'ve built the 7-day activity and 30-day calendar views. Plus, I\'ve handled milestone statuses and best streak preservation. I\'ve also integrated the AudioSettingsState with volume controls and sound effect routing, along with the UI components. Finally, I\'ve implemented the neon flame animations with tier scaling and reduced motion support.\n\n\n**Implementing UI Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now focused on the UI, specifically the `DashboardScreen`. I\'ve added the new \'STREAKS\' tab with all its components and a new audio settings trigger. I\'ve also added styling for the animations and slider. I\'m actively working on incorporating `streakState`, `sfxVolume`, `muted`, and `onOpenAudioSettings` into `App.tsx` and handling streak record outcomes and celebrations.\n\n\n"
