  planner_response {
    response: "**NEON BLOCK** has been upgraded with **Advanced Streak Visualization** and **Sound Effect Volume Control**, preserving all existing gameplay, scoring, Daily Challenges, 30-day rewards, combo history, achievements, XP, particle effects, and saved progress.\n\n### 1. Advanced Streak Visualization\n- **Dedicated Streaks Dashboard Tab**: Added a full **Streaks** view inside the Player Dashboard (reachable directly from the Title Menu, Sidebar streak counter, Dashboard Overview, or Celebration modal) displaying:\n  - **Current Daily Streak** and **Best-Ever Streak** with an animated **Neon Flame** tier indicator (`Dormant`, `Ignited`, `Electric Spark`, `Plasma Blaze`, `Supernova Flame`, `Immortal Flame`) that respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.\n  - **Consecutive Milestone Indicators** for **3, 7, 14, and 30 days**, tracking both active streak progress and all-time achieved milestones.\n  - **7-Day Activity Window** and **30-Day Activity Calendar** (22 past days, today, and 7 upcoming days) showing **Completed**, **Today Pending**, **Missed**, and **Upcoming** states, month/year transition labels, projected upcoming milestones, and interactive day details.\n  - **New Personal Record Celebration Modal**: Automatically triggers with fireworks, fanfare audio, and an animated neon flame whenever a new personal best streak is achieved.\n- **Local Calendar Streak Logic**:\n  - Uses the device\'s local `YYYY-MM-DD` calendar date across month, leap-year, and year boundaries.\n  - Counts a streak day only when completing the Daily Challenge or claiming the Daily Reward, preventing duplicate increments on the same day.\n  - Hydrates existing Daily Challenge and Daily Reward records automatically, preserves the best-ever streak across resets, never resets on app open/close, and recovers cleanly from missing or corrupted local storage.\n\n### 2. Sound Effect Volume Control\n- **Shared Web Audio SFX Gain Bus**: Routed every game sound effect through a shared `GainNode` with smooth `setTargetAtTime` ramping (anchored before scheduling to prevent audio clicks/pops), isolated so any future background music bus remains unaffected.\n- **Audio Settings Panel**:\n  - Accessible from the Title Menu, Sidebar, Mobile Header, Dashboard Header, and embedded directly inside the Pause menu.\n  - Includes a **0\342\200\223100% volume slider** (default **70%**), **\302\26110% Fire TV D-pad step buttons**, **Mute/Unmute toggle** (preserving saved volume and synced with the `M` shortcut), **Live Sound Preview**, and quick presets (**30% / 70% / 100%**).\n  - Persists settings locally (`neon_block_audio_v1`) with graceful fallback on missing or corrupted data, restoring volume and mute state cleanly after restarting.\n\n### Verification\n- Verified with automated regression tests covering streak calculations, same-day duplicate prevention, app restart preservation, month/leap-year/year boundaries, 3/7/14/30 milestone tracking, reward synchronization, corrupted storage recovery, Web Audio shared `GainNode` routing & smooth volume transitions, mute/unmute restoration, core board/tray mechanics, and menu navigation.\n- Confirmed clean TypeScript compilation (`tsc --noEmit`) and production build."
    message_id: "yCQEa7nDNsm6_uMP_abbmQs"
    modified_response: "**NEON BLOCK** has been upgraded with **Advanced Streak Visualization** and **Sound Effect Volume Control**, preserving all existing gameplay, scoring, Daily Challenges, 30-day rewards, combo history, achievements, XP, particle effects, and saved progress.\n\n### 1. Advanced Streak Visualization\n- **Dedicated Streaks Dashboard Tab**: Added a full **Streaks** view inside the Player Dashboard (reachable directly from the Title Menu, Sidebar streak counter, Dashboard Overview, or Celebration modal) displaying:\n  - **Current Daily Streak** and **Best-Ever Streak** with an animated **Neon Flame** tier indicator (`Dormant`, `Ignited`, `Electric Spark`, `Plasma Blaze`, `Supernova Flame`, `Immortal Flame`) that respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.\n  - **Consecutive Milestone Indicators** for **3, 7, 14, and 30 days**, tracking both active streak progress and all-time achieved milestones.\n  - **7-Day Activity Window** and **30-Day Activity Calendar** (22 past days, today, and 7 upcoming days) showing **Completed**, **Today Pending**, **Missed**, and **Upcoming** states, month/year transition labels, projected upcoming milestones, and interactive day details.\n  - **New Personal Record Celebration Modal**: Automatically triggers with fireworks, fanfare audio, and an animated neon flame whenever a new personal best streak is achieved.\n- **Local Calendar Streak Logic**:\n  - Uses the device\'s local `YYYY-MM-DD` calendar date across month, leap-year, and year boundaries.\n  - Counts a streak day only when completing the Daily Challenge or claiming the Daily Reward, preventing duplicate increments on the same day.\n  - Hydrates existing Daily Challenge and Daily Reward records automatically, preserves the best-ever streak across resets, never resets on app open/close, and recovers cleanly from missing or corrupted local storage.\n\n### 2. Sound Effect Volume Control\n- **Shared Web Audio SFX Gain Bus**: Routed every game sound effect through a shared `GainNode` with smooth `setTargetAtTime` ramping (anchored before scheduling to prevent audio clicks/pops), isolated so any future background music bus remains unaffected.\n- **Audio Settings Panel**:\n  - Accessible from the Title Menu, Sidebar, Mobile Header, Dashboard Header, and embedded directly inside the Pause menu.\n  - Includes a **0\342\200\223100% volume slider** (default **70%**), **\302\26110% Fire TV D-pad step buttons**, **Mute/Unmute toggle** (preserving saved volume and synced with the `M` shortcut), **Live Sound Preview**, and quick presets (**30% / 70% / 100%**).\n  - Persists settings locally (`neon_block_audio_v1`) with graceful fallback on missing or corrupted data, restoring volume and mute state cleanly after restarting.\n\n### Verification\n- Verified with automated regression tests covering streak calculations, same-day duplicate prevention, app restart preservation, month/leap-year/year boundaries, 3/7/14/30 milestone tracking, reward synchronization, corrupted storage recovery, Web Audio shared `GainNode` routing & smooth volume transitions, mute/unmute restoration, core board/tray mechanics, and menu navigation.\n- Confirmed clean TypeScript compilation (`tsc --noEmit`) and production build."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\332\002\n\327\002\001i\024}\023wa\254\203\001\256\304\2752\020,\020\021\312\377\234\255k\225c\346\302\367\026\347\224\323\020\254\224\241\t\321k\'\n\244\364\344\216\217\273\0203\026\367\020}w\227\226\257|*\233\3735\270\264\234\341\327\341B\345B~Y\304Z\235\237\343\366th\024\003\026x$\360\344YcHb\276\316q\3703\027\232\005g2%\210\336\367\317\005zaA\215SF\302V\357T\316\203\375_v\232\343\033q\367\3446\n\244n\345DF]h\210\231\320\021O6;B\204\330\277\302\242\rDY\263s\221\023MPi\312%\323\005=ZS\235\330L\035\375\355\275ni\257\003}\245{\2355rlW\344RY{\r\313\335\201k\214&\271\265g\203$\306\344\204\210\323$=G\202\n\3617\000\033\303T\242\373\366\235\2703\340\333\024\a\262\313\255\000\375\360\325\314\'<^m\r\356&\204\331e\364}\220\354?#F|\370\243\344\374\267G\274\340%\317$\265\343\366\002og\357\027\2076I\204\200\356mE\252\n\251R\232\206\205\220u\270\205\324O\220\340j\325:\360\340\272\253\3655/\022n\\\312=\273\034*FC\215\253\261LU\245\333c\313\3060 \006@\326\214\254i\004\344~KU\266\227\251"
